    <node id="Directive (EU) 2020/1828">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2020/1828</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2020/1828 focuses on improving the safety of consumer products and is relevant to AI systems regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2020/1828 is legislation concerning collective actions for consumer protection, repealing previous directives.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2020/1828 pertains to consumer protection laws in the digital context, also relevant to AI regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2020/1828 relates to collective actions for the protection of consumers, ensuring their interests are upheld in the digital marketplace.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2020/1828 relates to the improvement of the protection of collective interests of consumers, particularly in terms of sustainable consumption.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f7d41ecd7ed7ec26e62e63255378cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f182220530b59a4450fc951016283bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286</data>
