      <data key="d5">1783936122</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 establishes harmonized rules concerning artificial intelligence systems as safety components within the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is a comprehensive legislative act established by the European Parliament and Council, aimed at creating harmonized rules for artificial intelligence (AI) within the European Union. This regulation not only lays down standardized provisions for AI systems but also amends several existing regulations to ensure compliance and enhance safety in the deployment of AI technologies. As an upcoming legal framework, Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 focuses on ensuring that AI systems adhere to stipulated safety standards and operational guidelines, thereby promoting a structured and secure integration of artificial intelligence across the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is a legislative act by the European Parliament that outlines harmonized rules on artificial intelligence systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is a legal framework that lays down harmonized rules on artificial intelligence, impacting safety components in various sectors.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is a legislative act by the European Parliament setting harmonized rules on artificial intelligence and amending several previous regulations and directives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5a3ae528d10c9d38e017d520ab6719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7805654ce0fe0d8d9b6ba008562d2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e2499910b26136c66e6e7a013d8f0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84d660603389dd91dcd96134d5bb46e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b46b9cdd1723562953df9638581250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3acb107043f5850a72cf1b047a443296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c472ba24566e25512f738275d98a9e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_105.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_107.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_109.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_106.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_108.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_110.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_104.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_102.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_103.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Artificial Intelligence Act">
      <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence Act</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Artificial Intelligence Act includes comprehensive regulations that outline legal frameworks for the development and implementation of AI systems in the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The Artificial Intelligence Act is a regulatory proposal by the European Union that aims to establish a comprehensive legal framework for the use and governance of artificial intelligence technologies within its member states. Officially known as Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, the Act seeks to promote innovation while ensuring safety, ethical standards, and compliance across various sectors. It includes detailed provisions that outline safety requirements and compliance measures for AI systems, thereby providing harmonized rules to manage the development and application of artificial intelligence throughout the EU. Through this legislation, the EU intends to govern the use and development of AI, ensuring that all AI systems adhere to established safety and ethical guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6485ea34e7fea16b2f5a59242c8ef2a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5a3ae528d10c9d38e017d520ab6719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a68b7c657291244b183bd644e6df395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84d660603389dd91dcd96134d5bb46e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3acb107043f5850a72cf1b047a443296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286</data>
