      <data key="d0">European Parliament and Council</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Parliament and Council collaboratively enact regulations and directives for the governance of the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament and Council together represent the legislative power of the European Union, playing a significant role in creating laws and regulations.</data>
