      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EC) No 300/2008 outlines security provisions for the civil aviation industry, contributing to broader safety regulations for transport.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulations (EC) No 300/2008 relates to security operational standards for civil aviation in the EU.</data>
