    <node id="Official Journal of the European Union">
      <data key="d0">Official Journal of the European Union</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Official Journal of the European Union is the official publication of the European Union, serving as a vital source for disseminating legal documents, announcements, and legislative acts. It plays a crucial role in publishing information related to EU regulations and compliance standards, including aspects related to cybersecurity requirements. Additionally, the journal provides references to harmonized standards, which are essential for compliance assessments. Overall, the Official Journal of the European Union is the primary platform for the official publication and dissemination of EU legislation and regulatory information.&lt;SEP&gt;The Official Journal of the European Union is the publication in which EU legislation and decisions are officially published.&lt;SEP&gt;The Official Journal of the European Union is the publication through which the EU publishes its legislative acts and notifications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-39c5673a732c92c4eea89527b9e2e10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07b79b1855840c81b5d9079a82c7e9fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93fbd1f7fc7cbb860b708f989987b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9db4c15b43d1b7a1a1138d5a7403b240&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da5fbf959baa6ee8e86278864a9144cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762d138929f27b0266d948c0aad50daa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d423f15a7cbd742a57795f884434b60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f41337092de45470ab838aff17309ff</data>
