      <data key="d0">legal documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Legal documentation includes official texts, regulations, and announcements which are published to inform the public and relevant stakeholders.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-39c5673a732c92c4eea89527b9e2e10b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934120</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI Regulatory Sandbox">
      <data key="d0">AI Regulatory Sandbox</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The AI Regulatory Sandbox refers to controlled environments established by competent authorities to facilitate the development, testing, and training of innovative and high-risk AI systems. This framework is designed to enable stakeholders, including small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) and start-ups, to experiment with AI technologies while adhering to strict regulatory requirements and safeguards that ensure compliance with national and Union laws. 

The primary goal of the AI Regulatory Sandbox is to promote the safe and effective implementation of AI technologies by providing a structured regulatory environment where developers can test their AI products under specific eligibility criteria. This environment allows for the use of personal data in developing AI systems under specific legal conditions, ensuring that public interest is protected across various sectors. Overall, the AI Regulatory Sandbox serves as a vital tool for advancing innovation in AI while maintaining regulatory oversight and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI regulatory sandbox is a controlled testing environment for AI systems to ensure compliance with regulations while enabling innovation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6adb64ff4e7b459fa1df815eac98b096&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76c1f88e5810a7e79cf9527486831e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdf1c7e7ad7fe2c6b1b8f1b0b12db35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94b20fb25052b5f99e867bd24213f8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46250ea72037444e96653239f2893b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-475967c83e624bc711a9ff13e8150163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-699b82035d71a633a86a67090e5a61e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0271020749ae70ce56cbd607a6f6662a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85bb41c1db2d2e1883172e505d5f7b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8022b105f5e7e2d0ba74bbe75f31f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc036b3a79fdcd1eb36c0af6aafbb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a1516ad8d48077af0d59fc01578f33</data>
