      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A public authority is a government agency or body that exercises regulatory authority and provides public services.&lt;SEP&gt;Public authorities are organizations or government entities responsible for protecting public interest and implementing laws, often playing a role in AI development.</data>
