    <node id="Natural or Legal Person">
      <data key="d0">Natural or Legal Person</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A Natural or Legal Person can be an individual or organization that has legal rights and responsibilities, especially in relation to overseeing published content.&lt;SEP&gt;A natural or legal person is any individual or legal entity with grounds to submit complaints regarding possible infringements of regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;A natural or legal person refers to an individual or an entity (like a corporation) that can enter into legal agreements and has rights and responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A natural or legal person refers to any individual or legal entity that has legal rights and obligations, relevant in the context of confidentiality and data protection.</data>
