      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Union data protection law consists of legal frameworks that govern the protection of personal data within the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Union data protection law provides legal frameworks for the handling of personal data within the EU, ensuring users' rights are protected.&lt;SEP&gt;Union data protection laws are regulations put in place to protect personal data and safeguard individuals' rights concerning their data.</data>
