    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2018/1725">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2018/1725</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2018/1725 focuses on the processing of personal data by Union institutions and bodies, ensuring similar protections as those in the GDPR.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2018/1725 focuses on the protection of personal data by EU institutions, bodies, offices, and agencies, ensuring compliance with data protection standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2018/1725 is a comprehensive legal framework established to ensure the protection of personal data within European Union (EU) institutions and bodies. It outlines specific provisions related to the processing of personal data, emphasizing the safeguarding of individuals' rights and privacy. This regulation applies to various EU entities, including institutions, bodies, offices, and agencies, and governs the use and management of data and databases, notably including the EU database for artificial intelligence (AI) systems.

In addition to addressing general data protection, Regulation (EU) 2018/1725 includes provisions relevant to the processing of personal data within AI regulatory sandboxes. It encompasses rules surrounding the handling of various types of data, including sensitive biometric data, thereby ensuring compliance with data protection standards across the EU.

Overall, Regulation (EU) 2018/1725 is crucial for ensuring that personal data processing by EU institutions is conducted in a manner that respects and protects the privacy rights of individuals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-472b03a027e3fcae21e86e23849e4510&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3105f8ed20ed5608a4571fe7b1d8f942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68df7ac042ba1913236779113868f934&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8833999c9ef9aa31a007f2e77ffea02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b68fe088482c0037845fc0b520c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77093970e26d1be04734ed16ea88f777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46250ea72037444e96653239f2893b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-166a35f517674f4ceba2754c65f88c5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e726a1ef8f481d54c995afc6a028f60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-498834b2d84eaf9afe4e5fb0df15933c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2806e288e0b71013209c4ad85ecaa38b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a</data>
