    <node id="Sandbox">
      <data key="d0">Sandbox</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A sandbox is a controlled environment that allows experimentation and testing of AI systems under specific regulations and supervision.&lt;SEP&gt;The sandbox is a controlled testing environment designed for innovative technologies, particularly AI systems, allowing for experimentation with personal data under regulatory oversight.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85bb41c1db2d2e1883172e505d5f7b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_57.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934270</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Personal Data">
      <data key="d0">Personal Data</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Personal Data is defined as any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual. This type of data plays a significant role in the context of artificial intelligence systems and is governed by a range of regulations, notably the Regulation (EU) 2016/679. Personal Data encompasses all information processed by organizations concerning an identifiable natural person, ensuring that such data is subject to protection under various data protection laws, particularly those enacted in the European Union. 

This category of data also includes special types of information that require careful handling due to their sensitive nature. The handling of Personal Data must adhere to strict data protection regulations to maintain privacy and compliance within existing regulatory frameworks. Overall, Personal Data is crucial for safeguarding individual privacy rights while being involved in the deployment and utilization of AI components for diverse purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data encompasses any information that can identify an individual, such as names, addresses, and other identifiers, and must be handled according to data protection laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data refers to any information relating to individuals that must be protected and deleted after testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data refers to any data that relates to an identified or identifiable individual, which is protected under various regulations including GDPR.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-445327adc051facf545b6358f6f01466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc036b3a79fdcd1eb36c0af6aafbb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6e14583352886a741ac1d51eada03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f736e1ff707eaba05079b0f194d8a123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ef570a9dfbda3c55d0d5bcc36fd77c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5ee58307a02a795e806984f0ff4abe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8022b105f5e7e2d0ba74bbe75f31f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d18c3755735a13a436e766a5ca73fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_57.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_60.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_159.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_103.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_100.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_63.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_141.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_67.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_69.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935987</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Technical Documentation">
      <data key="d0">Technical Documentation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Documentation prepared by AI model providers detailing the usage and capabilities of their models for compliance and transparency.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical Documentation is a comprehensive collection of essential records and documents necessary to demonstrate compliance with regulatory standards for high-risk AI systems. This documentation serves multiple purposes and is crucial prior to the marketing or use of these AI systems. It encompasses detailed information regarding the development, testing, and validation processes of the AI system, along with associated test results and project summaries.

Furthermore, Technical Documentation includes records that articulate the rationale and outcomes of AI experiments conducted within controlled environments, often referred to as sandboxes. It ensures that all necessary information required to verify compliance and operational performance is meticulously maintained by providers. The documentation must adhere to the regulatory framework outlined in Annex XI, which assures that all necessary standards are met for the safe and effective deployment of AI technologies.

In addition to showcasing the compliance related to the deployment of these systems, Technical Documentation outlines the post-market monitoring and compliance processes. It represents the necessary paperwork that provides insights into the compliance and functioning of high-risk AI systems, encompassing detailed descriptions and instructions that must be retained by providers for regulatory adherence.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical documentation encompasses detailed records and descriptions of AI model functionalities, modifications, and data sources necessary for compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical Documentation is necessary for High-Risk AI Systems as it outlines the design, function, and operational processes relevant to the AI application.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-873c3732f26f3ace86c77cfec67991ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85fb9638473c0974347ccab540b99b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb5ca2a2f12bb39286916d398b70ed9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f56b40e98f8949a37c3ab283b01f7050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9685a1f72e235a3f5b9ee69878eedb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46418d497e0c090818a97380d173293d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36cb0fd5abf1b169a8aa13021f58c7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b754e2170dea6f93253ec4fd1fa88d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11bdaa862215570a86eed137e3092ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65c79a1c0cb37c10df906970d376029d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6</data>
