    <node id="Union Law">
      <data key="d0">Union Law</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Union Law encompasses all legal regulations and directives applicable within the governance framework of the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Union Law represents a comprehensive legal framework established by the European Union (EU) that governs a wide array of regulatory practices across various sectors, with a particular emphasis on biometric data and artificial intelligence (AI) systems. This body of legislation is designed to delineate the liability and responsibilities of providers during the testing and implementation of these technologies, ultimately aiming to safeguard public interests and uphold fundamental rights within the EU.

Within its scope, Union Law outlines acceptable practices and classification standards for the use of biometric data, ensuring a responsible approach to digital services while drawing attention to their societal impacts. It focuses on enhancing risk management procedures for AI systems, especially in sensitive areas such as law enforcement, where it seeks to mitigate risks linked to discrimination and the infringement of individual rights.

Additionally, Union Law encompasses broad data protection regulations that govern the lawful use of personal information and addresses the evaluation practices of individuals. Important provisions are included to protect the rights of copyright holders regarding permissible data use for AI training, promoting fair usage of information and addressing the challenges associated with personal data processing in AI applications.

Central to Union Law are the principles of equality and non-discrimination, which underpin the structured oversight mechanisms designed to prevent discrimination in the deployment of AI systems through adherence to compliance standards. Moreover, it comprises regulations applicable at the union level that impact multiple sectors, including high-risk technologies, migration, border control, and workplace rights.

Overall, Union Law is a crucial framework that intricately regulates the interaction between AI technology, data protection, and individual rights within the EU. It embodies a significant legislative effort to navigate the complexities of modern technology while upholding the values of the Union and ensuring compliance across its member states.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c3070277451614bdc67954ec8735dd80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ac689968d1b5ce1db014f781096bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7114fa80a4a18326b68b2fd61f65c047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1ab686ea2085e0bf2cc7ea2cb5eb270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08ef4cc90d0e3e23ebc122fef44151a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6e14583352886a741ac1d51eada03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4d08c48923bc3e8bff8968fd67a799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a30c75209c0fbb0ca1bb4afe44c77d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fde742696dfc1372a034cc9cadcb58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c9405f93ec3e0ccf6209ed15ef0263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431ae031d4ead528e84df75526b0f1dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4c7e75432b8ffa8e0b96687dc4dd380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-727225adfedcad573a12c2ed92e8ee1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71f538bc77dea56a19150de3c7514990&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44eafa4c222bb60e722eca942751cf7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54948128ea5a4b84a219d7dbaa346a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6adb64ff4e7b459fa1df815eac98b096&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8721c261d628c538814f61ffe3cec22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2118453abd880b63eddb91fa3806c3f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c31e49eb2274702ec6ced9550f1ca86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65e9562dd645622f1390ba1863fee19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc662d7e26079b23ad5010b8671bfb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffd8df9d8eb9625dca23bc5f974e025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85bb41c1db2d2e1883172e505d5f7b71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ded7b0ac022304fae10651966b33d18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5644d48de211c02e29152f909c69640b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc036b3a79fdcd1eb36c0af6aafbb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1adc61864fb9c4d0f971c9290506f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-800752b66b6fe0cd70bb0290efc2fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc37264ee8f2a814b7b6f98953de48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a350089bbf860c041d514aa2041d9455&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315cd7abb88dee440f081de5430a32f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8833999c9ef9aa31a007f2e77ffea02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a68b9cb2eff595118d2af9313b6c89f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf8a675497acfbeb420b95621b7cb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-445327adc051facf545b6358f6f01466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c664ec81872dda212b64d449aa7a2014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50beca99a2207