    </node>
    <node id="AI Project">
      <data key="d0">AI Project</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The AI Project developed in the sandbox aims to execute specific objectives and expected results, while being documented and summarized by competent authorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934122</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI System">
      <data key="d0">AI System</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Systems refer to a category of advanced technologies that utilize artificial intelligence to perform tasks typically requiring human intelligence, such as understanding natural language, recognizing patterns, making decisions, and generating and editing content. These systems are versatile and find applications across various sectors, including civilian, humanitarian, and military contexts. They consist of diverse components, including models, tools, and processes that enable them to exhibit intelligent behavior.

In the context of the European Union, AI Systems are classified as high-risk technologies due to their significant potential implications for health, safety, and fundamental rights. This classification necessitates strict compliance with specific regulations governing their deployment and usage. High-risk AI Systems undergo rigorous evaluations by notified bodies to ensure they meet market regulations. This process is supported by regulatory frameworks such as AI regulatory sandboxes, which facilitate the training, testing, and validation of these systems in real-world scenarios while emphasizing risk management.

Providers of AI Systems bear the responsibility for designing and determining the intended functionalities of these systems, ensuring they are deployed responsibly and safely across various domains. Despite their engineering aimed at enhancing human activities and outcomes, concerns regarding data protection rights are raised by their operations. Therefore, adherence to oversight and conformity assessments based on legislative regulations is crucial for effectively managing associated risks.

Furthermore, AI Systems require specific mechanisms for their proper functioning and maintenance, including routine software updates and logging procedures. They are designed to operate autonomously but have established protocols for their recall during testing phases under real-world conditions. Overall, AI Systems represent significant technological advancements with a wide range of applications, demanding careful consideration and compliance with legal and ethical standards to mitigate potential risks and uphold fundamental rights.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems refer to artificial intelligence technologies that are subject to testing and regulation as per the guidelines set by market surveillance authorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b4348ad8873ef2041aca94abc9297ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f69156748df83d9fa179140a3fe2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-610573a7c194ad780ed97782200a740c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c9405f93ec3e0ccf6209ed15ef0263f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07e8d113bd66975dbb8053a37cc427fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4c7e75432b8ffa8e0b96687dc4dd380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43e82a7af456b2ae813a7217f92c2008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64a2a65aec35f8304efaaee30e0034d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa7662f1a996e8ed97ec3caf0ae564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7d62750f1113d24ac155fcd2b2ef02c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8efd21db4fc63a879493cbb376ae904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6570d0db42cf764ebb073d69da0137e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2e0f993ca9c4e593e5fcbdd8fc03fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad9c740a10a5c1577e578a593bd61fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b235644744fa597c94328afbeaa7e56b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-071372b252509d0e29e64264c0511359&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc37264ee8f2a814b7b6f98953de48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17ccf2ddbeca1f4e8b771a2316b7d16c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a350089bbf860c041d514aa2041d9455&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4672fd3df7077626af67d20e46d3fcb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5da2f6b1c2fa5619efa26719534e9c35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ef570a9dfbda3c55d0d5bcc36fd77c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be61089eed18cfaf2703713378c589a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4ac0ccf9bd954306cee6efbfd342416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cc9a7191827dda78eda5924876e5f7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b5e606b14946a1b388f008868e8e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c17bf6e803eec807c9fc7299d71d51d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a64bfb94635a0df2f808b2f8a494bd3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345a8ba89ed0ea3325462384d5e16aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3ee1fc3ca38d0fe1cd19861a325e159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36cb0fd5abf1b169a8aa13021f58c7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb2802f1b508b813d06e58ae27a1f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2edb4e37d5b6a1ec68d071ea273b4e52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb3519876fdebea487c9995e6d3ae4fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f62cf38e10f73dd06a997571902c1ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0291da832d9defa94aaf2262ad3761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9575387945b55e197ecb0c955ef00f65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba5a4fee300868ea16940c9ea15f534a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_79.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_128.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_75.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_13.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_6.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_51.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_53.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_72.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_31.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_25.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_103.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_96.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_87.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_81.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_46.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_100.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_60.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_86.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_82.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_61.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_65.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_16.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_63.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_80.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_48.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_76.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_35.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_133.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_100.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_11.json</data>
