    </node>
    <node id="Annex IV">
      <data key="d0">Annex IV</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Annex IV is a critical component of regulatory frameworks concerning high-risk AI systems, containing specific technical documentation guidelines that impact the evaluation and assessment of modifications made to those systems. It outlines the requirements for technical documentation related to the conformity assessment process, ensuring that any substantial modifications are adequately reported and evaluated. Furthermore, Annex IV refers to a section within regulations that details necessary elements for the technical documentation of high-risk AI systems, including guidance on AI monitoring plans. It is designed to ensure compliance with required information and technical standards, which may be amended by the Commission as necessary, thereby providing a structured approach to managing the complexities of AI projects and their modifications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-55bfb9287798720e37fcd8bae961e88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e5d20a8e9427a4698b84f758676994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f56b40e98f8949a37c3ab283b01f7050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36cb0fd5abf1b169a8aa13021f58c7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4d62babb1c5a144faeae6ac2f13628</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_11.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_43.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_72.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935558</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Union Law on Personal Data">
      <data key="d0">Union Law on Personal Data</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Union Law on Personal Data sets the legal standards for processing personal data, ensuring compliance in the context of AI systems and other innovations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934122</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Criminal Offences">
      <data key="d0">Criminal Offences</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Criminal Offences are violations against the law that law enforcement authorities are tasked with preventing, investigating, and prosecuting.&lt;SEP&gt;Criminal Offences encompass acts that are punishable by law, requiring enforcement and prosecution by designated authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;Criminal offences encompass a range of illegal activities that law enforcement authorities aim to prevent, investigate, and prosecute.&lt;SEP&gt;Criminal Offences refer to specific violations of law that are outlined in the Union's legal framework, including those potentially linked to biometric identification.&lt;SEP&gt;Criminal offences are actions or omissions that violate the law and are subject to prosecution.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77ba8e0dd4981bd71dedb04a86b45601&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50be48c46c67191e901c756873069fcb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bccefc944ad0794c75bc69b977c88a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc036b3a79fdcd1eb36c0af6aafbb4d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_50.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_59.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_5.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Public Security">
      <data key="d0">Public Security</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Public Security pertains to the measures taken to ensure the safety and protection of citizens, often involving law enforcement activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Public security involves measures taken to ensure the safety and order of the public, often facilitated by law enforcement agencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Public Security refers to the protection of citizens from threats and emergencies, often influencing when and how AI systems are deployed.&lt;SEP&gt;Public security refers to the safety and protection of citizens and assets, which may necessitate the use of AI technology under urgent conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e07ee6b3452d764ccd9733dceadb1ac7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2612abd3c26dca69a0acec30add3ef15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa7662f1a996e8ed97ec3caf0ae564</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_130.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_46.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_24.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_59.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935517</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI">
      <data key="d0">AI</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI (Artificial Intelligence) is a rapidly evolving family of technologies that impact various industries by enhancing prediction, optimising operations, and personalising digital solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a rapidly developing family of technologies encompassing various applications and systems that require careful regulation and oversight. Defined as a field of study within computer science, AI focuses on creating systems capable of performing tasks typically requiring human intelligence, such as learning and problem-solving. While AI possesses significant potential for beneficial uses, it also carries inherent risks, including the possibility of misuse in manipulative and exploitative practices. To address these concerns, new regulations are being established to ensure the safety, protection of fundamental rights, and proper functioning of AI in the market. AI systems can pose risks and cause harm to public interests and rights when applied carelessly in different contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;AI refers to artificial intelligence technologies that are designed to perform tasks that would typically require human intelligence, such as reasoning, learning, and problem-solving.&lt;SEP&gt;AI refers to artificial intelligence, a significant technological development that can greatly impact society and should adhere to ethical and regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;AI refers to artificial intelligence, which involves the simulation of human intelligence processes by machines, especially computer systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-14f663363e3d8f01aa5c0b361bddc380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7114fa80a4a18326b68b2fd61f65c047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8bdbb57af24d78fe2313201571bea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a975f3ad5ea339c199a21dd569a7acb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdf1c7e7ad7fe2c6b1b8f1b0b12db35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58a25c0dd884625561b248cf275f154e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8462fb6c49f462e0c2199ce80842ebde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8f21b63428a38759e45ffcb10bac3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cde8f1eff9bf42001a30603a860556d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad86065dee426d0a1db7444552c4a385</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_28.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_20.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_28.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_6.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_8.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_67.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_5.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_138.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_4.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936281</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Union">
      <data key="d0">Union</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Union refers to the European Union (EU), a political and economic alliance comprising a collective of member states primarily located in Europe. This entity operates under a framework of agreed treaties and regulations, emphasizing cooperation among its member nations to establish common policies and guidelines, particularly concerning the deployment of artificial intelligence (AI) systems. 

At the core of the Union’s mission is the establishment of a robust regulatory framework aimed at promoting trustworthy AI. This includes developing standards that govern the creation, use, and regulation of AI technologies, particularly focusing on effectively managing and enforcing regulations concerning high-risk AI systems. The Union actively collaborates with competent authorities from its member states to ensure compliance and foster innovation, especially among small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs). To facilitate this, initiatives like regulatory sandboxes are implemented to enable experimental projects within a controlled regulatory environment.

In addition to its focus on AI governance, the Union places significant emphasis on data privacy and the protection of personal information, enhancing its regulatory landscape in these areas. It oversees compliance related to AI models and their providers, upholding the collective interests of its member nations. The Union also regulates various laws concerning data protection, nondiscrimination, consumer protection, and competition law, thereby reinforcing standardized regulatory approaches to support technological development and shared economic goals.

Moreover, the Union encompasses broader cooperation among European countries on a range of policies, including law enforcement, migration, border control, and asylum. It acts as an organized body that provides legal frameworks and protections for individuals and corporations regarding their rights and freedoms. Overall, the Union functions as a comprehensive entity dedicated to advancing technological development while maintaining governance and compliance to benefit its member states collectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-13b35a74627bd926656242d6545e09a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c14e1756e1d8d71ac3ba07125f122da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14f663363e3d8f01aa5c0b361bddc380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cac929d0048fe34377179e8ecde4a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ec68339f2da8ef06976767a0d5b494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08ef4cc90d0e3e23ebc122fef44151a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0044fdddd0a21caecd46a12639588d98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599d61ad7be34e2603c3fef13f2ff8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa2a9a43bd7a2482ad876b406b9e9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41cdee30f8345bc3690d876d77e6845c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe4d7c8b1c65cb7b9f5021681b13c271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3e6894a9009f1db207c0ec639d8a39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-828a2d9070cae319b764e3b609bc9b81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca7de1b4c82ecd24e2aef654437bd0e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f892644f7a3eab6b024d8a386777f23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3105f8ed20ed5608a4571fe7b1d8f942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-714d9f621f6eee9273625419653b083c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13991bdab077b3114e8913f89a1371e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dbd41da6ea2a77fff5beb18c8e7c896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e78bce1eaa5df9c186492b5e1482218&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50cb89ed7d0d818018d373ebefa65267&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1ae06c8c76fc5976313d75e4ffabdfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af991f85166d6ddfbbf84e4a73207d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4274f38f6b4aeff6dc2959e9e1a87f1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a90a47461f525bba18d74c42ea04f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ded1c99cfd152513a4ef07b96a9c5de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ef16386f45c7bc364061cc094254fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ad9c740a10a5c1577e578a593bd61fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76c1f88e5810a7e79cf9527486831e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3d60cf6cbe0ae91a9793cb5c98a4a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675b49fdde07175ec9a1afb693d1d877&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa9e2916955e882c73231ed69851f6ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bece07e296fce9647a40a0dde904fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0455405f9e173535e78c4ea589745cf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2ba08954f9ed754c2566e3c59b63ee7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dc307b8b7cb1f0e39aa9b4b1839c408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-111c71f234a0f2d1b26490907acae6eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f5fc2b531499a81e154196ee1e86ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99c78ffcf815fa82f05dcb7dc5871e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ed67e673a6fe0a3c79a41bb9102d44b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13bd6c41d609ae7976a7b3ac4ab8e3fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6de18717bcb0167956be85a15dd210f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea1514e01d99729cb280141a24250142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769497b509433ed0e4746ff50bbdec69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86aff1d72a3f6226d0b5db29d9910a59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb040a8b4e6e3fa6f26776f560b6591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778cb9e68fcb25e3f810e3cea927f7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65c79a1c0cb37c10df906970d376029d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_58.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_79.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_45.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_64.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_137.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_162.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_73.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_102.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_72.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_88.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_52.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_109.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_28.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_144.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_46.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_165.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_50.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_46.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_106.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_57.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_167.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_170.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_21.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_56.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_60.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_82.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_62.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_22.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_118.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_78.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_99.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_89.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_26.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_73.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_176.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_100.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936187</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Charter">
      <data key="d0">Charter</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Charter is a foundational document within the European Union that embodies and enshrines a set of fundamental rights, including health, safety, democracy, the rule of law, nondiscrimination, data protection, privacy, and the rights of the child. It serves as a guiding document that reflects the core values and principles that the Union upholds. The Charter guarantees various rights such as freedom of expression and the arts, which are particularly relevant when considering the implications of AI technologies in creative works. Its provisions primarily impact the deployment of AI systems and the legal principles surrounding personal data processing, emphasizing the importance of protecting individual rights in the context of technological advancement. Overall, the Charter plays a crucial role in shaping the legal and ethical framework of the European Union, ensuring that fundamental rights are respected and upheld.&lt;SEP&gt;The Charter serves as a basis for establishing common rules and standards for various rights, including health and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;The Charter outlines fundamental rights and freedoms, ensuring protection for various human rights including dignity, privacy, and non-discrimination.&lt;SEP&gt;The Charter refers to the Charter of Fundamental Rights of the European Union, which explains the fundamental rights and freedoms protected within the EU framework.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1eea61d03ab615ac5f518e77cd220c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14f663363e3d8f01aa5c0b361bddc380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41cdee30f8345bc3690d876d77e6845c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4acea71d2f59038573b7ec13db4ad10b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ded1c99cfd152513a4ef07b96a9c5de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0455405f9e173535e78c4ea589745cf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cde8f1eff9bf42001a30603a860556d1</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_48.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_28.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_134.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_176.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_63.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_59.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_6.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936279</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Human Dignity">
      <data key="d0">Human Dignity</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Human dignity is a foundational principle in the development of AI, emphasizing the respect for individuals' rights and personal integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;Human dignity is a fundamental value that emphasizes the inherent worth of every individual and is a core principle safeguarded by the Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-14f663363e3d8f01aa5c0b361bddc380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256a6003a5841f2764536c55f7086431</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_27.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_28.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934136</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Freedom">
      <data key="d0">Freedom</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Freedom refers to the state of being free from oppressive restrictions imposed by authority on one's way of life, behavior, or political views, an important value upheld by the Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-14f663363e3d8f01aa5c0b361bddc380</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_28.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934132</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Equality">
      <data key="d0">Equality</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Equality signifies the state of being equal, especially in status, rights, and opportunities, and is a fundamental principle promoted by the Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-14f663363e3d8f01aa5c0b361bddc380</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_28.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934132</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Democracy">
      <data key="d0">Democracy</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Democracy is a system of government by the whole population, typically through elected representatives, representing another key value of the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Democracy is a system of government in which power is vested in the people, who rule either directly or through freely elected representatives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-14f663363e3d8f01aa5c0b361bddc380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bedecbbbba0ded6846e6dc97756b7de5</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_28.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_62.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934823</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Rule of Law">
      <data key="d0">Rule of Law</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The rule of law is the principle that all people and institutions are subject to and accountable to the law, ensuring fairness in legal matters, which the Union supports.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-14f663363e3d8f01aa5c0b361bddc380</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_28.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934132</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Systems are sophisticated technological frameworks that harness artificial intelligence to execute tasks typically requiring human intelligence, such as decision-making, problem-solving, and behavior prediction based on data inputs. These systems incorporate a variety of AI technologies and methodologies, and they are classified by associated risk levels, particularly concerning health, safety, and fundamental rights. High-risk AI Systems, which may involve biometric identification and extensive data analysis to predict behaviors, are subjected to rigorous regulatory measures owing to their significant implications for individual rights and societal welfare. This has sparked essential discussions about transparency and the ethical use of these technologies.

The integration of AI Systems is widespread, spanning diverse sectors such as military operations, security, law enforcement, humanitarian efforts, and national security. They enhance responses to criminal activities through effective risk assessment and evidence evaluation. By combining general-purpose AI models with user interfaces, AI Systems improve operational efficiency and decision-making processes. Continuous research, performance evaluations, and regulatory oversight are vital to maintaining accuracy, robustness, and cybersecurity throughout their existence.

In addition to their operational roles, AI Systems significantly affect human behavior in key areas, including electoral processes and workplace decision-making. These systems utilize algorithms and analytics for applications such as facial recognition, which raises important privacy concerns. In workplace contexts, AI Systems are crucial for recruitment, evaluation, and management decisions, highlighting the necessity of addressing their ethical implications upon deployment.

AI Systems are also employed to evaluate or score individuals based on social behavior, personal characteristics, and contextual information. In specialized fields like migration, asylum, and border control management, these technologies aim to enhance operational efficiency while adhering to legal frameworks, underscoring the need for governance and ethical compliance to mitigate associated risks.

Recognized as high-risk products, AI Systems require adherence to established regulations to manage risks and ensure safety, particularly within the European Union context. Their transformative potential emphasizes the necessity for ethical governance and responsible deployment, prioritizing standards that effectively address inherent risks while promoting beneficial societal integration. Furthermore, robust cybersecurity measures are crucial to safeguard against threats and vulnerabilities linked to these systems, which can include manipulative designs that may distort human behavior based on their functionality and application. Finally, AI Systems are also utilized in the education sector to improve digital education and training, focusing on vital skills such as media literacy and critical thinking.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems refer to software and algorithms that perform tasks typically requiring human intelligence, including learning, reasoning, and problem-solving.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems refer to technologies designed to identify individuals remotely through biometric data in public spaces, often used for law enforcement purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems are technologies designed to interact with natural persons, generating content and performing tasks, raising issues of impersonation and deception.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems refer to software and technologies that perform tasks typically requiring human intelligence, which are subject to regulations requiring enforcement.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77ba8e0dd4981bd71dedb04a86b45601&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cac929d0048fe34377179e8ecde4a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649ac2acd7b1a3b0b6a81ce20aa799f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5ee58307a02a795e806984f0ff4abe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7fd511ed97ef1a87c9783c3425b7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3105f8ed20ed5608a4571fe7b1d8f942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-064e3e5273a81cd8d9a47da9a3f51240&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b474f9815c7033ca1ad8daff4012eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6a8294e2a2ad2569029d260c4d7673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa7662f1a996e8ed97ec3caf0ae564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b3ba2302e956849a6be7455071577d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-543cc911c9d837b54a06d5f6ca958b34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5981afe4b9fb547c64f49e76b1d9c0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae8bdbb57af24d78fe2313201571bea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decd01dd1bf25270eddf9979fe28678a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8833999c9ef9aa31a007f2e77ffea02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a0ae2ebdd7c0c6e56069b878ca85c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46d97529092ce970fc3194f0ff15f99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb2802f1b508b813d06e58ae27a1f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f62cf38e10f73dd06a997571902c1ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb040a8b4e6e3fa6f26776f560b6591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1ab686ea2085e0bf2cc7ea2cb5eb270&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18cf1aa30864348514b20fe64038fba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5fb48082255c480535475ddb098366a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397d6e2474c4f45e883f265653f2e715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2440fb0070f3198e96bd1ad753ae3e0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d88f95110db00bbf8230a2632a2035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71f538bc77dea56a19150de3c7514990&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b68fe088482c0037845fc0b520c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31c82fb046f107cbfab945a92431bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc662d7e26079b23ad5010b8671bfb7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ef16386f45c7bc364061cc094254fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28717558f1bb8bd2fd8b9542f8e2a99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c76dd7edbc6dcf218d6558d18116d52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-737358b61293029e1a6d7326160654fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ab1f3b6cbb052c58ff3b9fc75a6d7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee1f186f5aed070bc8e6e813caed9967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99c78ffcf815f