    <node id="Privacy and Data Governance">
      <data key="d0">Privacy and Data Governance</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Privacy and data governance is one of the ethical principles aimed at ensuring compliance with data protection laws in AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Privacy and data governance refers to the principles ensuring that AI systems comply with privacy and data protection rules while processing high-quality data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-849f8f0403e6b12fa8a9c24b84c094c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-256a6003a5841f2764536c55f7086431</data>
