    <node id="Ethical Principles">
      <data key="d0">Ethical Principles</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Ethical Principles refer to the foundational guidelines intended to govern behavior and inform decision-making regarding various practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Ethical principles guide the development of AI, encouraging practices that ensure fairness, transparency, and privacy.</data>
