    <node id="General-Purpose AI Models">
      <data key="d0">General-Purpose AI Models</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">General-Purpose AI Models are AI systems designed for a wide range of tasks and applications, subjected to regulations for adherence and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;General-Purpose AI Models are versatile artificial intelligence systems specifically crafted to perform a broad spectrum of tasks across multiple applications. These models utilize both pre-trained and training datasets, which often include a mixture of public and private databases, allowing them to generate diverse types of content, including text and images.

A key characteristic of General-Purpose AI Models is their seamless integration into various systems, highlighting their adaptability and significance within the field of artificial intelligence. Despite being publicly accessible and available under free and open-source licenses, these models do not fall under the same regulatory frameworks as high-risk systems. However, due to their wide-ranging applications and the potential systemic risks associated with their misuse, there is an increasing demand for regulatory oversight to ensure their safe and effective utilization.

The deployment of General-Purpose AI Models must adhere to specific legal requirements, particularly in relation to compliance with standards of transparency and copyright law. This underscores their relevance in compliance evaluations across various use cases. While these models present significant opportunities for creators and users, they also introduce challenges that require careful consideration in their applications. Overall, General-Purpose AI Models exemplify the adaptability and extensive applicability of artificial intelligence, reaffirming their importance in the contemporary technological landscape while also posing implications for safety and regulatory compliance as mandated by relevant regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models refer to AI systems intended for a wide range of applications, subject to specific compliance obligations as per the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;General-Purpose AI Models are artificial intelligence systems designed for multiple applications, which can pose systemic risks that need to be managed through regulatory requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5c4d08c48923bc3e8bff8968fd67a799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-161f3120961644fbdc17c7b09b46e54b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49e78c25e30ed3a2557915010f14f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fcd3af92cad1d85ebf561f059acb114&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649ac2acd7b1a3b0b6a81ce20aa799f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40a9e2a0fc4601f4b3d4f583384b6a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1ae06c8c76fc5976313d75e4ffabdfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6570d0db42cf764ebb073d69da0137e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfc036b3a79fdcd1eb36c0af6aafbb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bee8a141261944c2193bcb00b304b768&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577494efd5ce842563e6974b0da9707b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc37264ee8f2a814b7b6f98953de48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b90abf0636c26d546e9b6724e3224ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1ef1c9ca92c002cf6ad36264fe1292c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8a6b92fbe8d93eb878957c5ed60aa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32556db3a80f72f1db354810bba21be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5429fed5961ecea1e5eed049e922476f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769497b509433ed0e4746ff50bbdec69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447d51c65bac6d28fd62c36c3e70e08b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e23760d52ebfb589b4de63afe8ab83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18d33fd192f06f727ac6bb21becbaa57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-778cb9e68fcb25e3f810e3cea927f7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65c79a1c0cb37c10df906970d376029d</data>
