    <node id="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">High-Risk AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">High-Risk AI Systems are a prominent category of artificial intelligence technologies identified by the European Union (EU) due to their potential to significantly impact health, safety, and fundamental human rights. These systems pose considerable risks, particularly in critical sectors such as healthcare, law enforcement, criminal investigations, migration and border control, and the financial sector, which includes banking and insurance.

To ensure the safety and reliability of High-Risk AI Systems, strict regulatory frameworks have been established. These frameworks mandate comprehensive conformity assessments that verify compliance with safety and efficacy standards, emphasizing the importance of high-quality training, validation, and testing datasets. In accordance with EU harmonization legislation, these systems must obtain CE markings and meet national registration requirements prior to being marketed or operationally deployed.

The management and oversight of High-Risk AI Systems involve meticulous risk management strategies aimed at mitigating vulnerabilities, particularly concerning cybersecurity threats. Policymakers, regulators, and stakeholders in AI governance play a critical role in formulating stringent performance benchmarks for accuracy, robustness, and cybersecurity throughout the lifecycle of these technologies. The primary objective of these regulatory measures is to protect individual rights, promote societal well-being, and enhance overall safety, while acknowledging the profound implications that High-Risk AI Systems can have on democratic processes and personal freedoms.

Given their potential for harm or bias, especially related to biometric identification and categorization, High-Risk AI Systems are subject to rigorous regulations requiring advanced monitoring and logging capabilities to ensure their safe operational functioning and traceability. These regulations necessitate thorough evaluations and clear compliance requirements as tailored to specific operational environments. Consequently, the stringent supervision and regulation of High-Risk AI Systems are vital in preventing misuse, discrimination, and other adverse outcomes, reinforcing the need for careful governance and documentation in their deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems in education potentially influence access, admissions, and learning evaluations, posing significant implications for individuals' educational trajectories.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems refer to artificial intelligence applications that pose potential risks to health, safety, and fundamental rights, requiring stringent regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems are classified as AI technologies that pose significant ethical or safety concerns, requiring stricter regulatory oversight according to Union guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems are those deemed to pose significant risks to health and safety, subject to specific requirements under the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77ba8e0dd4981bd71dedb04a86b45601&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a1d78baf29c07c65edc311f0ca04126&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe4515f5aa3b0876e436a8a0dffc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5ee58307a02a795e806984f0ff4abe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7fd511ed97ef1a87c9783c3425b7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f74259ac0ec20e9f3989df868f56b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68df7ac042ba1913236779113868f934&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-543cc911c9d837b54a06d5f6ca958b34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72498ec90c19419f10373dde7e7b51b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1d05b847c03fe702172f787883fc33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a57bbcc3ccf00f26352f12c36036aedf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70337c5367702b9a8ef4dd8a241aa46d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69838403e8b59bb122436a0d25a9fc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a68b9cb2eff595118d2af9313b6c89f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff61ec794793cf787d4a0473487a06f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dc307b8b7cb1f0e39aa9b4b1839c408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b0c31436f0e7ce27ce5952aa2bf9ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13bd6c41d609ae7976a7b3ac4ab8e3fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-166a35f517674f4ceba2754c65f88c5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8caee37338a6383c30fe06ea2b3e4761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c168b1207668ad4ba646371f91bfce09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6e14583352886a741ac1d51eada03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78dcdae0f5d22df28405d8ae03e038d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3e6894a9009f1db207c0ec639d8a39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d88f95110db00bbf8230a2632a2035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71f538bc77dea56a19150de3c7514990&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b68fe088482c0037845fc0b520c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44eafa4c222bb60e722eca942751cf7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5ccbca443324af303d8bca3aa31a38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31c82fb046f107cbfab945a92431bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4882abf1dd869d3dff00b8d88ee946a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ef16386f45c7bc364061cc094254fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5644d48de211c02e29152f909c69640b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d7d6f2dd7e28584da10fdb340b37fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e978e96ac6d99cf448b53260c07dded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9685a1f72e235a3f5b9ee69878eedb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68d6983d829937a84d37118dacc3e39c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d423f15a7cbd