    </node>
    <node id="Risk Management System">
      <data key="d0">Risk Management System</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A Risk Management System is an integral part of the operational framework for providers of high-risk AI systems, focusing on identifying and mitigating potential risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The risk management system detailed in Article 9 refers to protocols established to anticipate, mitigate, and report risks associated with high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The risk management system is a structured process aimed at identifying, evaluating, and mitigating risks associated with high-risk AI systems throughout their lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;The risk management system is a framework that organizations must implement to assess and mitigate risks associated with high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1952e0d35566561db978f8ee1ebdbd3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32bc5fa5cdfa35a393a42535dc4fdfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac68c725e087cb7c659f2dd75f0a6e34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_8.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_9.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935947</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Post-Market Monitoring System">
      <data key="d0">Post-Market Monitoring System</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Post-market monitoring systems are frameworks established by providers of AI systems to assess performance and address any emerging risks after deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Post-Market Monitoring System is a framework established to continuously assess the performance and safety of high-risk artificial intelligence (AI) systems following their deployment in the market. These systems are employed by providers to gather, analyze, and respond to feedback and data concerning the operational performance and associated risks of AI systems. The main objective of the Post-Market Monitoring System is to ensure ongoing oversight and compliance with safety and quality standards, as outlined in Article 72, which emphasizes the importance of continual surveillance after an AI system is released. This comprehensive approach facilitates the identification and management of potential risks, ensuring that high-risk AI systems operate safely and effectively in real-world applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-44eafa4c222bb60e722eca942751cf7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54948128ea5a4b84a219d7dbaa346a50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac68c725e087cb7c659f2dd75f0a6e34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f56b40e98f8949a37c3ab283b01f7050&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32bc5fa5cdfa35a393a42535dc4fdfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43e82a7af456b2ae813a7217f92c2008</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_9.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_81.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_72.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_155.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935937</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Article 72">
      <data key="d0">Article 72</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 72 discusses the requirements for establishing and maintaining a post-market monitoring system for AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 72 outlines requirements related to the post-market monitoring of high-risk AI systems and data analysis for risk evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 72 specifies the requirements for setting up, implementing, and maintaining a post-market monitoring system for high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 72 pertains to post-market monitoring requirements for high-risk AI systems, emphasizing their ongoing oversight.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32bc5fa5cdfa35a393a42535dc4fdfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac68c725e087cb7c659f2dd75f0a6e34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff0d16c0510c298943e3daa75fd581b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_9.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_12.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935952</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Article 13">
      <data key="d0">Article 13</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 13 mandates the provision of information required for the proper deployment of high-risk AI systems, including user training.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 13 refers to provisions for providing information and training related to the use of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 13 refers to a regulation concerning the testing of AI systems in real-world conditions, outlining roles and responsibilities for providers and deployers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6f6e14583352886a741ac1d51eada03a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a68b9cb2eff595118d2af9313b6c89f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_9.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_60.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935797</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Risk Management Process">
      <data key="d0">Risk Management Process</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The risk management process refers to the systematic approach taken to identify, evaluate, and mitigate risks associated with high-risk AI systems throughout their lifecycle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_9.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934157</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Health and Safety">
      <data key="d0">Health and Safety</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Health and Safety encompasses a comprehensive framework designed to protect individuals from risks associated with the use of AI systems. This concept prioritizes well-being in the design and deployment of these technologies, ensuring that appropriate conditions and standards are in place to safeguard individuals from potential harm. Health and safety concerns specifically focus on addressing the dangers posed by high-risk AI systems to personal health, safety, and fundamental rights.

The framework leads to the development of vital policies and regulations aimed at protecting individuals' well-being in the face of emerging technologies. Health and Safety measures are essential protections that must be adhered to when deploying AI systems, preventing harm to individuals and communities. These measures revolve around the establishment of regulations and practices that ensure physical well-being and provide protection against risks, particularly in relation to the impacts of new technologies like AI.

Furthermore, Health and Safety includes the protocols and standards that safeguard the well-being of individuals, especially in workplace and public environments. Overall, Health and Safety represents critical protections and frameworks necessary for mitigating risks to individuals and society when engaging with innovative technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Health and safety are paramount concerns in the management of critical infrastructure, aiming to protect individuals from risks associated with failures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-65f69156748df83d9fa179140a3fe2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c2f867de2be6cb439557f91700b051c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe49d95d50900e82a706b2766339562f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec6a8294e2a2ad2569029d260c4d7673&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fde742696dfc1372a034cc9cadcb58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18cf1aa30864348514b20fe64038fba8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d88f95110db00bbf8230a2632a2035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e17b101216d20a500f79a31d9a0d7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21acb22d994b8f65ea3709a99eb85032&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_48.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_20.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_130.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_9.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_52.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_55.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_65.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_47.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936195</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Fundamental Rights">
      <data key="d0">Fundamental Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Fundamental Rights are a collection of essential legal entitlements and protections guaranteed to every individual under international law, encompassing rights such as dignity, privacy, freedom of expression, social protections, and non-discrimination. These rights are crucial to safeguard individuals' freedoms, particularly in the context of emerging technologies like artificial intelligence (AI). 

The deployment of high-risk AI systems presents potential threats to these rights, making the consideration of how such technologies respect and protect individuals' entitlements imperative. Regulatory frameworks emphasize the importance of upholding Fundamental Rights to prevent discrimination and to ensure the dignity and rights of all individuals are respected. This includes designing technologies with safeguards against biases, especially in sensitive contexts such as migration and asylum, where the protection of individual freedoms is essential.

Fundamental Rights are recognized by various entities, including the European Union, where they aim to protect citizens from abuses and guarantee their dignity and freedom. Overall, these rights represent the core legal protections granted to individuals, advocating for principles of equality and non-discrimination that must be upheld regardless of technological advancements. The protection of Fundamental Rights must be a primary focus during the development and deployment of AI systems to ensure ethical considerations are met and to prevent infringements on personal liberties.&lt;SEP&gt;Fundamental Rights are the basic human rights and freedoms that are guaranteed to all individuals, often protected by legal frameworks and societal norms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95424b9dff57302628c496570b4baff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7114fa80a4a18326b68b2fd61f65c047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fde742696dfc1372a034cc9cadcb58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62e8b28075fdfa33850ed4b5a4d9a52f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8f21b63428a38759e45ffcb10bac3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d88f95110db00bbf8230a2632a2035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b68fe088482c0037845fc0b520c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ca7c773df7242c37f506b8ad3db475b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b474f9815c7033ca1ad8daff4012eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31c82fb046f107cbfab945a92431bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffc59c087d680631c2a594779449f195&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0271020749ae70ce56cbd607a6f6662a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e284955c1d36330bd14d117bb417611&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315cd7abb88dee440f081de5430a32f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe49d95d50900e82a706b2766339562f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc97d8ad7f3aa0522d885f92ee323822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58a25c0dd884625561b248cf275f154e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-595952fa3e7e47cb312adaaad303b73c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46d97529092ce970fc3194f0ff15f99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21acb22d994b8f65ea3709a99eb85032&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b5e606b14946a1b388f008868e8e155&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77a0a99b47c288a96d7474c796efb766&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c664ec81872dda212b64d449aa7a2014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c2f867de2be6cb439557f91700b051c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d42aaf56c15be020feabced14d2409d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3f18a6d766d2baa57ae891b9da7741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d44e4d07784e334a8ded2c1da49b969e</data>
