      <data key="d0">Technical Specifications</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical Specifications refer to the detailed requirements that artificial intelligence systems must meet to ensure compliance with applicable regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical specifications refer to detailed descriptions of features and functions required for compliance with regulations, particularly for AI systems.</data>
