    <node id="Special Categories of Personal Data">
      <data key="d0">Special Categories of Personal Data</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Special Categories of Personal Data refer to sensitive data types that require strict handling due to their potential for bias and privacy concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;Special categories of personal data are sensitive data types requiring additional protection, as defined under data protection laws and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Special categories of personal data pertain to sensitive information that requires additional safeguards during processing.&lt;SEP&gt;These categories are defined in specific EU regulations concerning sensitive personal information.</data>
