    <node id="Emotion Recognition System">
      <data key="d0">Emotion Recognition System</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An Emotion Recognition System is an AI application designed to identify and interpret human emotions based on various signals, often requiring strict regulatory compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;An emotion recognition system is a type of AI system that processes personal data to recognize and categorize emotional expressions of individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;An emotion recognition system uses AI to deduce or identify emotions from biometric data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Emotion Recognition System is an AI system designed to identify or infer emotions and intentions of individuals based on their biometric data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2bccefc944ad0794c75bc69b977c88a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61cbf514bcfe4869e269c00a2dc9e712&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0373d38f7600f51def3b5e5cb5061d17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ac98f64f8751ad51246ca16d843f030</data>
