    <node id="Remote Biometric Identification System">
      <data key="d0">Remote Biometric Identification System</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A Remote Biometric Identification System is a technology used for identifying persons through biometric data in real-time, typically for law enforcement purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;A remote biometric identification system is an AI technology designed for identifying individuals without their involvement, often comparing biometric data from a reference database.&lt;SEP&gt;A system for conducting biometric identification from a distance, utilizing AI technology for recognition.&lt;SEP&gt;The Remote Biometric Identification System is a technology used to identify individuals based on their biometric data, regulated by legal frameworks to ensure compliance with privacy laws.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ffc59c087d680631c2a594779449f195&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-071372b252509d0e29e64264c0511359&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f62cf38e10f73dd06a997571902c1ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ac98f64f8751ad51246ca16d843f030</data>
