    <node id="personal data">
      <data key="d0">personal data</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Personal data includes any data pertaining to identified or identifiable natural persons, particularly in the context of privacy regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data refers to any information related to an identified or identifiable natural person as defined within the regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data refers to any information relating to an identified or identifiable natural person, as defined by various legal frameworks including EU regulations.</data>
