    <node id="Directive (EU) 2016/680">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2016/680</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2016/680 is a legislative act focused on the protection of individuals in relation to the processing of personal data by competent authorities within the European Union. It establishes comprehensive rules that govern how personal data, especially sensitive biometric information, is handled specifically for the prevention, investigation, detection, and prosecution of criminal offenses. The directive is designed to safeguard individual privacy rights while enabling effective law enforcement activities, thereby striking a balance between public safety and personal data protection.

This directive is crucial for regulating the management of personal data in the context of police and judicial cooperation in criminal matters, emphasizing the lawful processing of data in the criminal justice sector. By enhancing data protection standards for law enforcement across the EU, Directive (EU) 2016/680 also holds particular significance for the deployment of AI systems, reflecting its relevance to modern policing practices. Overall, it delineates legal standards for the processing of personal data by competent authorities facilitating crime prevention and prosecution, ensuring that individual rights are upheld alongside law enforcement needs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f736e1ff707eaba05079b0f194d8a123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0efde0679d72a2d51e7acdaf09979bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de40ca48bf7dafc1db86f4d8a18d2bba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-498834b2d84eaf9afe4e5fb0df15933c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602b68fe088482c0037845fc0b520c30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68df7ac042ba1913236779113868f934&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4882abf1dd869d3dff00b8d88ee946a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a46250ea72037444e96653239f2893b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1d05b847c03fe702172f787883fc33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cb5eb81289d4fb565bd824bdc63506&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bccefc944ad0794c75bc69b977c88a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e726a1ef8f481d54c995afc6a028f60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8da189e7622be67a80b2e12945a657cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bece07e296fce9647a40a0dde904fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4988a00689afb1245e0f0ce4ceef5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-737358b61293029e1a6d7326160654fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77a0a99b47c288a96d7474c796efb766&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee1f186f5aed070bc8e6e813caed9967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0373d38f7600f51def3b5e5cb5061d17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f</data>
