      <data key="d0">Union Member States</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Union Member States refers to the countries that are part of the European Union, which are collectively impacted by laws and regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3266d68b5262e6852cabbe36178dec96</data>
