    <node id="General-Purpose AI System">
      <data key="d0">General-Purpose AI System</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A General-Purpose AI System refers to an artificial intelligence framework that is capable of performing multiple tasks across varied applications, characterized by its integration of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;A General-Purpose AI System utilizes a general-purpose AI model to serve multiple functions and can be integrated into other systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-afea58b87ff95e4731bff6457b0b57c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9575387945b55e197ecb0c955ef00f65</data>
