    <node id="Floating-Point Numbers">
      <data key="d0">Floating-Point Numbers</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Floating-Point Numbers are real numbers represented in a format that allows for a wide range of values by using a fixed-number of digits to represent magnitude and precision.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-decd01dd1bf25270eddf9979fe28678a</data>
