      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Mathematical Operation includes processes such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, or division, applied to numbers to perform calculations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-decd01dd1bf25270eddf9979fe28678a</data>
