    <node id="Council of the European Union">
      <data key="d0">Council of the European Union</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Council of the European Union plays a crucial role in shaping EU legislation, including those regarding the processing of personal data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Council of the European Union, alongside the European Parliament, plays a crucial role in discussing and adopting data protection regulations and legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Council of the European Union, also known as the Council of Ministers, is an essential EU institution that works with the European Parliament to adopt legislation and coordinate policies among member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The Council of the European Union, commonly referred to as the Council of Ministers, is a pivotal institution within the European Union (EU) that plays a significant role in the legislative and decision-making processes. Composed of government ministers from each EU member state, the Council collaborates with the European Parliament in the legislative process, including the development of significant legislation such as the Artificial Intelligence Act and the Digital Services Act.

As one of the main decision-making bodies of the EU, the Council not only focuses on general laws but also coordinates specific policies across various domains, such as cybersecurity and artificial intelligence. It represents the interests of the governments of EU member states, ensuring that their diverse perspectives are integrated into coherent EU policies.

The Council works closely with the European Parliament to adopt and amend legislation, thereby influencing policies and regulations that affect member states. Through its activities, it embodies a collective approach to governance in the EU, reflecting the commitment to collaboration among member states in creating effective laws and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Council of the European Union, commonly called the Council, is one of the EU's key decision-making bodies, which works alongside the European Parliament.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5a5a3ae528d10c9d38e017d520ab6719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4fa1ad79284c6e1a9636113352a8e0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be3ac2351d8798fda8093d05f96f97fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3e6894a9009f1db207c0ec639d8a39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7fd511ed97ef1a87c9783c3425b7d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a48f68b8943ab2f8e6bdbb9ccf3e17d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15eee417af0ebe299ed66be76a0b845a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f1483cdf6b84729e33ebc4a611375b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17045c951f494f621b2305960aade53f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4219a2a10d85ddd82f98b8d6267cb9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6badc71855b10bbd17a31c7dfef0c442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cb5eb81289d4fb565bd824bdc63506&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84d660603389dd91dcd96134d5bb46e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af24a9a67de887431d611cc88e6df8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74def3a33d9c60f3c11227adf7704a09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85605aee8aaac2bf4ad29d80d902148f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdc616126c9eed60b2893f6f0c5a24b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e2499910b26136c66e6e7a013d8f0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6370e960da03a6bbdee69f64993cdae6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fa5fe9ac042448be58de6c82bb33ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb00b9eef4af47cdd3264cd99d6b2e4</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_158.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_104.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_11.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_33.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_109.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_121.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_46.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_175.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_77.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_49.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_29.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_108.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_102.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_173.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_103.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_74.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_9.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935987</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Commissions Implementing Powers">
      <data key="d0">Commissions Implementing Powers</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Commission’s Implementing Powers refer to the authority conferred to the European Commission to execute legislation as mandated by the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3fa5fe9ac042448be58de6c82bb33ea4</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_175.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934173</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Natural Persons">
      <data key="d0">Natural Persons</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Natural persons are defined as individual human beings who possess the legal capacity and authority to represent a provider or deployer within the context of the EU database. Distinct from legal entities, they typically engage with artificial intelligence (AI) systems in personal or non-professional capacities. Their emotions and intentions may be analyzed through biometric data, making them significantly affected by decisions made by high-risk AI systems. 

These individuals have rights under specific regulations concerning their health, safety, and fundamental rights, which are critical given the potential implications of AI technologies on their lives, such as affecting access to public assistance benefits and evaluations of creditworthiness. The roles and rights of natural persons are crucial in legal and bureaucratic contexts, particularly concerning issues like social scoring and biometric identification, highlighting the need for protective measures against discrimination and the safeguarding of individual dignity.

Natural persons may also have supervisory roles, overseeing the operation of high-risk AI systems to ensure safety and mitigate potential misuse. Their expertise and awareness are essential in validating AI system identifications, especially in addressing issues such as automation bias. Furthermore, they face risks related to critical infrastructure disruptions and criminal activities, which underscores the importance of their training and preparedness in navigating these challenges.

Overall, natural persons hold a vital and unique position in the interaction with high-risk AI systems, emphasizing the interplay of their rights and responsibilities, as well as the broader impact of AI technologies on their lives within the framework of regulations designed to protect their health and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural persons refer to human individuals who interact with AI systems and possess rights and freedoms as per the relevant regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural persons indicate individuals whose biometric data can be subjected to identification processes, raising concerns over their rights and freedoms.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural persons refer to individuals who interact with AI systems and should be notified of their engagement with such technologies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b4348ad8873ef2041aca94abc9297ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18e4ea35b819263359794e3a968f44ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dead6db59d178a53a4fc03ed67a92e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431ae031d4ead528e84df75526b0f1dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89491b02af0a00cbc13f9e8df827a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31c82fb046f107cbfab945a92431bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2118453abd880b63eddb91fa3806c3f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c4d127e5313d415dd94f6b6761da956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-878d589bc7b69ae2d9c3a44284a1badc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72498ec90c19419f10373dde7e7b51b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4274f38f6b4aeff6dc2959e9e1a87f1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bccefc944ad0794c75bc69b977c88a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1d05b847c03fe702172f787883fc33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23e03a78af2035b69e69bd4fc65a435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ef16386f45c7bc364061cc094254fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61cbf514bcfe4869e269c00a2dc9e712&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5644d48de211c02e29152f909c69640b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ded7b0ac022304fae10651966b33d18c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83317eda1161cf5d13ef9aa07297c98b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb43ec5a01dc502046ab6ffbe3a25504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8833999c9ef9aa31a007f2e77ffea02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c5a915dca180e1c423cefa27ea6cd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ed67e673a6fe0a3c79a41bb9102d44b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28efea7f8fe5945cce5b7be57e88efe7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aff0d16c0510c298943e3daa75fd581b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd27f4cf61449e217b2273c0cf67adfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab148daacc5693b15ec462635a5502a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f62cf38e10f73dd06a997571902c1ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3f18a6d766d2baa57ae891b9da7741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1be166c61f466e23c3d8c143f6efd3bb</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_32.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_130.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_132.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_6.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_73.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_58.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_14.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_50.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_44.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_59.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_17.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_12.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_93.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_5.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_33.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_26.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_31.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_12.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_97.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_71.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936285</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Artificial Intelligence Systems">
      <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Artificial Intelligence Systems are technology solutions designed to perform tasks typically requiring human intelligence, like data processing and analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence Systems refer to computational systems designed to perform tasks that normally require human intelligence, with implications in law enforcement for risk assessment and decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial intelligence systems are technology applications that can perform tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as decision-making, problem-solving, and learning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c2f867de2be6cb439557f91700b051c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbcf833252ce65fd6a1d8bd1f5a6efc1</data>
