    <node id="Article 97">
      <data key="d0">Article 97</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 97 is a significant provision within the regulatory framework that grants the Commission the authority to adopt delegated acts aimed at modifying regulations concerning artificial intelligence (AI) systems and their associated risks. This article specifically empowers the Commission to amend technical documentation to ensure compliance with established requirements. Furthermore, it outlines the provisions under which the Commission can adjust regulations related to high-risk categories of AI systems, including the ability to modify the list of high-risk AI systems as needed.

In addition to these powers, Article 97 delineates the responsibilities of the Commission in relation to regulatory compliance, authorizing it to elaborate on methodologies and amend annexes in response to advancements in technology. Overall, Article 97 serves as a crucial mechanism for maintaining up-to-date regulations that reflect the evolving landscape of AI technology and its associated risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 97 outlines the procedures and powers granted to The Commission for amending legislative acts.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 97 refers to a legal provision that guides the Commission in adopting delegated acts concerning AI model classifications and thresholds.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-55bfb9287798720e37fcd8bae961e88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdd0ab3aadbdd5226fa3661ea9057181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe49d95d50900e82a706b2766339562f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e519b84a1d0987cd3b0aab32a476aa33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb1edc11e8b8d0e952b15617a80f379&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5abff9e94aff7675c473268fd21bf551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4d62babb1c5a144faeae6ac2f13628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0291da832d9defa94aaf2262ad3761</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_51.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_7.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_47.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_43.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_6.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_53.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_11.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935720</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Use-cases of High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">Use-cases of High-Risk AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Use-cases of High-Risk AI Systems refer to specific applications or scenarios in which AI systems might pose significant risks to health, safety, or fundamental rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fe49d95d50900e82a706b2766339562f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_7.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934190</data>
    </node>
    <node id="National Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d0">National Competent Authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">National Competent Authorities (NCAs) are designated governmental bodies within the European Union responsible for overseeing and ensuring compliance of artificial intelligence (AI) systems with relevant regulations in their respective jurisdictions. They play a crucial role in monitoring high-risk AI systems to ensure adherence to legal and safety standards, thereby safeguarding fundamental rights throughout the deployment and operation of these technologies.

The primary functions of NCAs include assessing and enforcing regulations, supervising the implementation of AI regulatory sandboxes, and providing essential support for compliance with laws. They are tasked with reporting any adverse effects of AI systems to the relevant European Commission, contributing to a transparent and accountable AI ecosystem. Composed of experts in AI technologies, data protection, cybersecurity, and legal standards, NCAs operate independently and impartially, ensuring objectivity in their regulatory functions.

In addition to their monitoring responsibilities, NCAs facilitate the operation of AI regulatory sandboxes at the national level, designed to evaluate AI systems' implementation and to confirm their regulatory compliance. They inform applicants of their compliance-related decisions, maintaining the integrity of the AI sector. NCAs hold the authority to manage legal infringements and may impose administrative fines according to the national legal framework.

Overall, National Competent Authorities are essential for the safe and responsible adoption of AI technologies, reaffirming their commitment to safety, legal compliance, and fundamental rights. They function as local regulatory entities focused on fostering a compliant AI landscape within their jurisdictions, ensuring that providers of high-risk AI systems adhere to relevant regulations and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Official organizations responsible for overseeing the implementation of regulations related to AI models and monitoring compliance among providers.&lt;SEP&gt;National Competent Authorities are entities responsible for establishing and managing AI regulatory sandboxes in their jurisdictions, ensuring compliance and cooperation with other regulatory bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;National Competent Authorities are organizations responsible for overseeing the implementation of regulations and ensuring compliance within their jurisdictions, especially regarding AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95424b9dff57302628c496570b4baff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac68c725e087cb7c659f2dd75f0a6e34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca56f82b70892874784bcec5c2bb2c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599d61ad7be34e2603c3fef13f2ff8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49e78c25e30ed3a2557915010f14f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0779dfb4a5c0f82f05a67985fe0224a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184360d53ae652d7f48a919e168f375a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6adb64ff4e7b459fa1df815eac98b096&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64a2a65aec35f8304efaaee30e0034d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7859a0c655f74761757b416c3b50bf36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c31e49eb2274702ec6ced9550f1ca86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46418d497e0c090818a97380d173293d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdf6e3e080867f88ec52fa9fabbeafd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-873c3732f26f3ace86c77cfec67991ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4672fd3df7077626af67d20e46d3fcb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dbe8a4749b15b91fcb1062fee4fa778&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe49d95d50900e82a706b2766339562f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc97d8ad7f3aa0522d885f92ee323822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11bdaa862215570a86eed137e3092ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50beca99a2207706ee9f0ad17a4205ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22275ba6343521309923fef233affa2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d08b537f9a5bb2b4f4bbdf442ba39bdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe05ef9eea0acc63f05d5b9d6a147298&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdf1c7e7ad7fe2c6b1b8f1b0b12db35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36cb0fd5abf1b169a8aa13021f58c7b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d42aaf56c15be020feabced14d2409d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447d51c65bac6d28fd62c36c3e70e08b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98532c431ec75ae38c76dc0730337a16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32bc5fa5cdfa35a393a42535dc4fdfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34333cde7ca701413cb4d0a0ef1129e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577494efd5ce842563e6974b0da9707b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69b5f24963810305f2a7846d54923bf0</data>
