    <node id="Post-Remote Biometric Identification Systems">
      <data key="d0">Post-Remote Biometric Identification Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Post-Remote Biometric Identification Systems are AI technologies utilized by law enforcement to identify individuals based on biometric data, subject to strict regulatory oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;Post-remote biometric identification systems refer to technologies used to identify individuals from video footage after the fact and have specific privacy regulations associated with their use.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4882abf1dd869d3dff00b8d88ee946a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de40ca48bf7dafc1db86f4d8a18d2bba</data>
