    <node id="Directive (EU) 2019/790">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2019/790</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2019/790 establishes rules on copyright and related rights in the Digital Single Market, influencing the release and compliance of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2019/790 is a European legal framework that outlines copyright and related rights in the digital environment, impacting AI model providers.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2019/790 is a legislative measure that introduces exceptions for text and data mining, allowing certain uses of copyright-protected content under specific conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2019/790 outlines laws regarding copyright and related rights in the digital single market, specifically addressing AI models and their usage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4dc89de2edca5d2bfe0d5e9e7c99665b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5429fed5961ecea1e5eed049e922476f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1ae06c8c76fc5976313d75e4ffabdfc</data>
