    <node id="General-purpose AI models">
      <data key="d0">General-purpose AI models</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">General-purpose AI models are AI systems that can generate text, images, and other content, offering both innovation opportunities and challenges for creators.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models are versatile artificial intelligence systems that can perform a range of tasks but may pose systemic risks if not managed properly.</data>
