    <node id="Large Generative AI Models">
      <data key="d0">Large Generative AI Models</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Large generative AI models are a specific type of general-purpose AI that can produce extensive amounts of text and multimedia content.&lt;SEP&gt;Large generative AI models are advanced types of artificial intelligence that can produce various forms of content, including text, audio, images, and videos for multiple applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8033b978339bfb2f89fde823ffa3f524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5429fed5961ecea1e5eed049e922476f</data>
