      <data key="d0">competent authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Competent authorities are national bodies designated by Member States to ensure adherence to the regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent authorities are regulatory bodies designated within the Union to monitor compliance with AI safety regulations and standards.</data>
