      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">National minority indicates a specific category of individuals in terms of their ethnic or cultural identity, which may be included in biometric categorization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac04e8bc9dd9ff3998ce3c08f3800f57</data>
