    <node id="Directives (EU) 2016/2102 and (EU) 2019/882">
      <data key="d0">Directives (EU) 2016/2102 and (EU) 2019/882</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">These EU directives set forth accessibility requirements for digital services and products, influencing the standards for high-risk AI systems in terms of accessibility.</data>
