    </node>
    <node id="Customs Authorities">
      <data key="d0">Customs Authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Customs authorities are government agencies responsible for enforcing laws concerning the import and export of goods and ensuring compliance with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4274f38f6b4aeff6dc2959e9e1a87f1a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_42.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934272</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI-Predicted Behaviour">
      <data key="d0">AI-Predicted Behaviour</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI-predicted behaviour encompasses judgments made about individuals based solely on artificial intelligence analytics, excluding human discretion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4274f38f6b4aeff6dc2959e9e1a87f1a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_42.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934272</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Profiling">
      <data key="d0">Profiling</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Profiling involves the assessment and categorization of individuals based on traits such as nationality or personality, often for predictive purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4274f38f6b4aeff6dc2959e9e1a87f1a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_42.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934272</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Risk Assessments">
      <data key="d0">Risk Assessments</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Risk Assessments are evaluations conducted using AI systems to predict the likelihood of a natural person committing a criminal offense based on their behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk assessments evaluate the potential risks associated with individuals based on specific behaviours or characteristics, typically employed in legal contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk assessments in AI involve evaluating the potential impacts and safety of AI systems concerning individual rights and public safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ae8bdbb57af24d78fe2313201571bea7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4274f38f6b4aeff6dc2959e9e1a87f1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83317eda1161cf5d13ef9aa07297c98b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_42.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_5.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_3.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935965</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Criminal Activity">
      <data key="d0">Criminal Activity</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Criminal activity refers to actions that violate laws and may be predicted through risk assessments, but require objective evidence for prosecution.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4274f38f6b4aeff6dc2959e9e1a87f1a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_42.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934272</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Objective Verifiable Facts">
      <data key="d0">Objective Verifiable Facts</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Objective verifiable facts are concrete, demonstrable pieces of evidence that can substantiate claims regarding an individual's behavior or actions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4274f38f6b4aeff6dc2959e9e1a87f1a</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_42.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934272</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Human Assessment">
      <data key="d0">Human Assessment</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Human assessment involves evaluating an individual's actions or characteristics based on objective and verifiable evidence, particularly in the context of criminal activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Human assessment refers to the evaluation of individuals by people rather than algorithms, emphasizing personal evaluation in legal contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers to the evaluation conducted by human agents prior to the implementation of AI systems, ensuring that the AI does not replace human judgment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4672fd3df7077626af67d20e46d3fcb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4274f38f6b4aeff6dc2959e9e1a87f1a</data>
