      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 67 pertains to the advisory forum mentioned in the context of preparing common specifications for AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 67 refers to the advisory forum involved in the process of creating common specifications and standards.</data>
