      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 22 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012 outlines the committee that the Commission must inform before preparing a draft implementing act.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 22 outlines the committee involved in the drafting process of implementing acts related to EU regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4f41337092de45470ab838aff17309ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010f171cc1a7f217689efe00fd8cb656</data>
