    <node id="Implementing Acts">
      <data key="d0">Implementing Acts</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Implementing Acts are specific legal acts adopted to detail how certain laws or regulations will be enforced or operationalized.&lt;SEP&gt;Implementing acts are regulatory measures adopted by the European Commission to enforce existing laws and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Implementing acts are legislative measures that the Commission can establish to detail further specifications necessary for compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Implementing Acts refer to the legal measures that the Commission adopts to specify the rules and procedures for AI regulatory sandboxes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bec338e77f01240f23cac5480d2c8ae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aca56f82b70892874784bcec5c2bb2c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010f171cc1a7f217689efe00fd8cb656&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24261c10195e33e965bd7e966c33337</data>
