      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Common Specifications serve as guidelines under EU regulations that provide a coherent framework for compliance and standardization.&lt;SEP&gt;Common specifications refer to a set of technical requirements and standards that high-risk AI systems must comply with according to EU regulations.</data>
