    <node id="Scientific Research">
      <data key="d0">Scientific Research</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Scientific research encompasses all activities related to the exploration and experimentation necessary for the advancement of knowledge, particularly in AI development.&lt;SEP&gt;Scientific research entails the systematic investigation into AI systems for the purpose of discovering and developing new knowledge and technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Scientific research is a systematic investigation designed to develop or contribute to generalizable knowledge, adhering to ethical and professional standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4ffd8df9d8eb9625dca23bc5f974e025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1adc61864fb9c4d0f971c9290506f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8833999c9ef9aa31a007f2e77ffea02</data>
