      <data key="d0">Regulations (EU) 2017/746</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulations (EU) 2017/746 focus on in vitro diagnostic medical devices, setting out essential requirements and conformity assessment procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulations (EU) 2017/746 relate to in vitro diagnostic medical devices, including provisions for safety and performance oversight applicable to AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1b0c31436f0e7ce27ce5952aa2bf9ae5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70555b8168fcbd401cc11093ec15091a</data>
