    <node id="Testing and Experimentation Facilities">
      <data key="d0">Testing and Experimentation Facilities</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Testing and Experimentation Facilities are specialized labs or environments where AI systems are tested for compliance and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing and Experimentation Facilities provide infrastructure and resources for the practical application and validation of AI technologies in regulated environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing and experimentation facilities are established by the Commission and Member States to support compliance with regulations and foster innovation.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing and experimentation facilities are spaces accredited to conduct evaluations and trials of products or devices in accordance with EU regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7859a0c655f74761757b416c3b50bf36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba662546e18e6e5f82c3cd1c5b4c3b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc97d8ad7f3aa0522d885f92ee323822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70555b8168fcbd401cc11093ec15091a</data>
