      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Union AI Testing Support Structures are designated by the Commission to perform AI-related tasks as mandated by Regulation (EU) 2019/1020.&lt;SEP&gt;Union AI Testing Support Structures are entities aimed at helping Member States enforce regulations concerning AI systems, enhancing their capabilities.</data>
