    <node id="European Harmonised Standards">
      <data key="d0">European Harmonised Standards</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">European Harmonised Standards are regulatory guidelines that provide specifications for compliance regarding various products and services, including AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;European Harmonised Standards provide a framework for compliance and conformity relating to general-purpose AI models and their obligations under EU law.&lt;SEP&gt;European harmonised standards provide guidelines that ensure consistency in compliance for AI models across the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4dc89de2edca5d2bfe0d5e9e7c99665b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c49e78c25e30ed3a2557915010f14f3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cfbca03bf6afb99c3326dc8b02d083b</data>
