    <node id="Providers of General-Purpose AI Models">
      <data key="d0">Providers of General-Purpose AI Models</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Providers of General-Purpose AI Models are entities that create, distribute, and market AI systems designed to perform a wide range of tasks across various applications. These providers focus on developing general-purpose AI models which can be adapted for multiple uses. Given the potential systemic risks associated with these technologies, they are required to comply with specific regulatory obligations before specific implementation dates. This ensures that their AI solutions adhere to established standards and guidelines while being offered to the market.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers of general-purpose AI models refer to entities that develop and offer AI systems intended for various applications, subject to regulations on safety and efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers of general-purpose AI models include various organizations and entities that develop, supply, or utilize AI systems for diverse applications, responsible for compliance with regulatory obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers of general-purpose AI models are entities or individuals that develop or supply AI technologies designed for diverse applications, subject to specific compliance regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c4dc0271c68856282748506ff58069b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-161f3120961644fbdc17c7b09b46e54b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47ce3f90343791af10ffae2a7848f26e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cfbca03bf6afb99c3326dc8b02d083b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa2a9a43bd7a2482ad876b406b9e9c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8e23760d52ebfb589b4de63afe8ab83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8a6b92fbe8d93eb878957c5ed60aa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65c79a1c0cb37c10df906970d376029d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69b5f24963810305f2a7846d54923bf0</data>
