    <node id="Adversarial Testing">
      <data key="d0">Adversarial Testing</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Adversarial Testing involves evaluating AI models to identify weaknesses and mitigate risks, an essential practice for providers of general-purpose AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Adversarial Testing is a methodology used to evaluate AI models against certain threats by simulating malicious inputs to assess security.</data>
