      <data key="d0">Cybersecurity Protection</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Cybersecurity Protection involves measures required to safeguard AI models from vulnerabilities and threats, ensuring their safe deployment and usage.&lt;SEP&gt;Cybersecurity Protection involves measures to secure AI models and their infrastructure against threats and risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Cybersecurity protection encompasses measures to safeguard AI models and infrastructure against malicious attacks, unauthorized access, and accidental leaks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-447d51c65bac6d28fd62c36c3e70e08b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cfbca03bf6afb99c3326dc8b02d083b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bee8a141261944c2193bcb00b304b768</data>
