      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">European Harmonised Standards are compliance guidelines that, once published and assessed, grant providers presumption of conformity regarding obligations under the AI Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;European harmonised standards refer to regulations set by the European Union to ensure compliance and safety in various practices and industries.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fce1cda52753ec9e5183762f5b2c81b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8a6b92fbe8d93eb878957c5ed60aa0</data>
