    <node id="Asylum">
      <data key="d0">Asylum</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Asylum involves the protection granted to individuals who flee persecution or serious harm in their home countries.&lt;SEP&gt;Asylum processes might utilize high-risk AI systems, related to identification and verification as stated in legal guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Asylum is a form of international protection granted to individuals who flee their home country due to persecution or fear of persecution.&lt;SEP&gt;Asylum refers to the protection granted to individuals who flee persecution or danger in their home country, often involving legal considerations.</data>
