    <node id="Innovation">
      <data key="d0">Innovation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Innovation encompasses the development of new technologies and methodologies aimed at enhancing the capabilities and applications of AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Innovation refers to the process of developing new ideas and technologies, particularly in the context of AI systems, which is crucial for economic growth and competitiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;Innovation refers to the process of developing new ideas and technologies, particularly in the context of artificial intelligence, where regulatory sandboxes are designed to foster experimentation and development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95424b9dff57302628c496570b4baff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdf1c7e7ad7fe2c6b1b8f1b0b12db35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964</data>
