      <data key="d0">Risks to Health, Safety or Fundamental Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Risks to health, safety, or fundamental rights are potential dangers associated with the operation of high-risk AI systems if not properly managed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c4d127e5313d415dd94f6b6761da956</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934336</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Anomalies and Malfunctions">
      <data key="d0">Anomalies and Malfunctions</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Anomalies and malfunctions refer to unexpected behaviors or failures in high-risk AI systems that necessitate monitoring and intervention by natural persons.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c4d127e5313d415dd94f6b6761da956</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934336</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Automation Bias">
      <data key="d0">Automation Bias</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Automation bias is a cognitive bias where people overly rely on the output of automated systems, which can lead to errors in judgment or decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Automation bias is the tendency of individuals to over-rely on output from AI systems, which can lead to misinterpretation or poor decision-making.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c4d127e5313d415dd94f6b6761da956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2118453abd880b63eddb91fa3806c3f3</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934336</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Market or Service Launch">
      <data key="d0">Market or Service Launch</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The market or service launch refers to the process of introducing a high-risk AI system into the market, requiring compliance with safety measures and protocols.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4c4d127e5313d415dd94f6b6761da956</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_14.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934336</data>
    </node>
