      <data key="d5">1783936018</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EC) No 765/2008">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EC) No 765/2008</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EC) No 765/2008 establishes rules regarding the market surveillance of products in the EU, impacting various sectors, including AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EC) No 765/2008 is a European Union regulation that establishes the framework for the CE marking and conformity assessment of products.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EC) No 765/2008 outlines accreditation requirements and is a significant legal framework within the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation outlines the requirements for accreditation and aims to ensure market surveillance and compliance of products within the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EC) No 765/2008 governs the framework for accreditation and market surveillance in the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b474f9815c7033ca1ad8daff4012eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff05678672211287e9053ebcd9c1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c712c6235ebe0b7ee5102919bbe87d08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29241e99bddf5af77eca441d2d8dbc1b</data>
