    <node id="conformity assessment procedures">
      <data key="d0">conformity assessment procedures</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Conformity assessment procedures are regulatory measures taken to verify that AI systems meet required standards and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Conformity assessment procedures are systematic processes used to determine whether a product meets necessary legal requirements for CE marking and regulatory compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0461b38c664574f634a78148bfce0336&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29241e99bddf5af77eca441d2d8dbc1b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_48.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_38.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935704</data>
    </node>
    <node id="packaging">
      <data key="d0">packaging</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Packaging refers to the materials used for wrapping or enclosing products, which can also include information such as CE marking when direct labeling on the product is impractical.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-29241e99bddf5af77eca441d2d8dbc1b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_48.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934345</data>
    </node>
    <node id="promotional materials">
      <data key="d0">promotional materials</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Promotional materials refer to advertising content that may include information about a product's compliance with CE marking, enhancing consumer trust in its safety and efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-29241e99bddf5af77eca441d2d8dbc1b</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_48.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934345</data>
    </node>
    <node id="other law">
      <data key="d0">other law</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The other law represents a set of legal regulations or requirements that apply to high-risk AI systems, ensuring their operation within legal frameworks and protection of public interest.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75ffbd2452fab424919d626f5688692d</data>
