      <data key="d5">1783934345</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EU">
      <data key="d0">EU</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Union (EU) is a political and economic union comprising member countries primarily located in Europe. It establishes common regulations and standards that govern various sectors, including high-risk AI systems, technology, and financial services. The EU serves as a governing authority that sets regulatory frameworks to ensure the conformity of high-risk AI systems before they are introduced to the market. Additionally, it enacts regulations, directives, and practices that encompass numerous areas, including but not limited to data protection. The EU operates under collective institutions and laws that facilitate cooperation and compliance among its member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union (EU) is a political and economic union of member states located primarily in Europe, known for establishing regulations and directives across various sectors, including the regulation of artificial intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is a political and economic union of member states located primarily in Europe that governs various regulations and policies.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union (EU) is a political and economic union of member states located primarily in Europe, facilitating common legislation and regulations such as consumer protection and accessibility standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is a political and economic union of member states that are located primarily in Europe, responsible for creating and enforcing regulations such as those concerning AI.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7f74259ac0ec20e9f3989df868f56b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68df7ac042ba1913236779113868f934&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec3aceb64afa671f57d404e61126379b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17045c951f494f621b2305960aade53f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85fb9638473c0974347ccab540b99b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdd0ab3aadbdd5226fa3661ea9057181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a68b7c657291244b183bd644e6df395&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46418d497e0c090818a97380d173293d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e7606a0fa9d588f18d67d02cfcf654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f116a95954c59b63ce3149e6283ed8e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_105.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_47.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_49.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_18.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_29.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_108.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_23.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_66.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936098</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Importers">
      <data key="d0">Importers</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Importers are entities responsible for bringing high-risk AI systems to the market and ensuring compliance with EU regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers are entities responsible for ensuring compliance with regulations for high-risk AI systems during their storage and transport.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers are individuals or entities that bring AI systems and components into a market, and they must adhere to specific obligations under the regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers are individuals or entities that bring AI systems into the Union for use or distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers are entities that need to follow specific obligations under the regulations regarding the importation of goods.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e7365f713d09e74d49090cb78cb3e19b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13991bdab077b3114e8913f89a1371e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85fb9638473c0974347ccab540b99b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-197c7357cf5fefe6ca4e08f847ff6a75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fc356102e8bbeed5152b8bb0cda2ff6</data>
