    <node id="European Council">
      <data key="d0">European Council</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Council is a crucial institution within the European Union, composed of the heads of state or government of its member countries. It plays a significant role in guiding EU policy by defining the Union's overall political direction and priorities. The European Council is responsible for setting the long-term agenda and policies of the EU, outlining principles and strategic guidelines that influence various areas, including the development and ethical considerations of artificial intelligence (AI).

Additionally, the European Council works collaboratively with the European Parliament to establish policies and regulations, including notable frameworks such as Regulation (EU) 2019/881 and the Data Act. Through its legislative involvement, the European Council ensures that the EU's political framework is aligned with the collective interests and goals of its member states, reinforcing its pivotal position in shaping European policies and legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Council is responsible for setting the EU's overall political direction and priorities, working closely with the European Parliament on legislative matters.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Council is an institution of the European Union that defines the general political direction and priorities, contributing to legislation like Regulation (EU) 2023/988.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9317b056c2a260423c79e368903cde7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3f7d41ecd7ed7ec26e62e63255378cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f182220530b59a4450fc951016283bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec0d2d3cbe2a53a3bbf6373c775edf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f37d4143e19486af167d7acee5bee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b3ba2302e956849a6be7455071577d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-511a9744e58c5bca320f1c98646693c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8f21b63428a38759e45ffcb10bac3d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3acb107043f5850a72cf1b047a443296&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b0054dbaea0e7f90c303fe7d7a824d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb30099cdacdc2f1eb2ed182c6b4491&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eb5283f4e280f1ec77650d624699286&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119d91aacb77775b61f5eddaf23771be</data>
