    <node id="AI Regulations">
      <data key="d0">AI Regulations</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Regulations refer to the legal frameworks established to oversee the development, implementation, and testing of AI technologies while ensuring safety and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Regulations refer to the set of rules and standards implemented to govern the development and use of artificial intelligence technology.</data>
