    <node id="Public Interests">
      <data key="d0">Public Interests</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Public Interests refer to the collective concerns and welfare of society, particularly in health, safety, and fundamental rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Public interests include health, safety, democracy, and environmental protection which the AI regulation aims to safeguard.&lt;SEP&gt;Public interests encompass the welfare and well-being of the general population, which can be threatened by technological advancements such as AI.</data>
