      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulations encompass the rules and directives that are subject to reporting under Directive (EU) 2019/1937, ensuring compliance and accountability within organizations.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulations refer to the specific rules established by governing bodies like the European Union to manage and oversee the usage of AI technology and ensure compliance with ethical standards.</data>
