      <data key="d0">Harmonised Rules</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Harmonised Rules refer to the standardized regulations that govern the market and usage of high-risk AI systems across EU member states, ensuring consistency and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Harmonised rules are standardized regulations created within the EU framework to ensure consistency and coherence in the application of laws among member states.</data>
