      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Intermediary services are platforms or systems that facilitate interactions or transactions between users or entities, often involving the use of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Intermediary services include platforms and services that facilitate interactions or transactions between parties, potentially impacted by regulations on AI.</data>
