    <node id="Civil Protection Authorities">
      <data key="d0">Civil Protection Authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Civil Protection Authorities focus on protecting citizens from emergencies and disasters and may also use AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Civil protection authorities are tasked with protecting citizens and may also deploy high-risk AI systems in emergencies.</data>
