      <data key="d0">EU Member States</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">EU Member States are countries that are part of the European Union and are involved in the regulatory process for high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;EU Member States refer to the countries that are part of the European Union and are involved in establishing regulations and protocols regarding AI systems.</data>
