    <node id="Death of a Person">
      <data key="d0">Death of a Person</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Death of a Person, in this context, pertains to serious incidents involving high-risk AI systems that could lead to fatalities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0dc307b8b7cb1f0e39aa9b4b1839c408</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_73.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934445</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Initial Report">
      <data key="d0">Initial Report</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Initial Report allows providers to submit incomplete information about serious incidents while they gather more data for a complete report.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0dc307b8b7cb1f0e39aa9b4b1839c408</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_73.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934445</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Competent Authorities Involvement">
      <data key="d0">Competent Authorities Involvement</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Competent Authorities Involvement refers to the participation of designated bodies during investigations of serious incidents related to AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0dc307b8b7cb1f0e39aa9b4b1839c408</data>
