    <node id="Council Framework Decision 2002/584/JHA">
      <data key="d0">Council Framework Decision 2002/584/JHA</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Council Framework Decision 2002/584/JHA establishes the European arrest warrant and outlines surrender procedures between Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;This event outlines the European arrest warrant and the processes of surrender between Member States, emphasizing cooperation in law enforcement.&lt;SEP&gt;This refers to a legislative framework in the European Union that outlines provisions for cooperation in criminal matters among Member States.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6badc71855b10bbd17a31c7dfef0c442&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d91755cda6acde2b40257e6d4cef1695&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a23e03a78af2035b69e69bd4fc65a435</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934474</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Article 2 of Directive (EU) 2022/2557">
      <data key="d0">Article 2 of Directive (EU) 2022/2557</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 2 of Directive (EU) 2022/2557 provides definitions and guidelines pertaining to critical infrastructure and associated threats.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d91755cda6acde2b40257e6d4cef1695</data>
