      <data key="d5">1783934474</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Article 2, point (4) of Directive (EU) 2022/2557">
      <data key="d0">Article 2, point (4) of Directive (EU) 2022/2557</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 2, point (4) of Directive (EU) 2022/2557 defines critical infrastructure and outlines its importance for public safety and order.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a23e03a78af2035b69e69bd4fc65a435</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_33.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934478</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Council Directive 2008/114/EC">
      <data key="d0">Council Directive 2008/114/EC</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">This directive focused on the protection of critical infrastructure in the European Union prior to being repealed by Directive (EU) 2022/2557.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6badc71855b10bbd17a31c7dfef0c442</data>
