      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Decision No 768/2008/EC establishes a common framework for the marketing of products and is key in regulatory compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision No 768/2008/EC is a part of the New Legislative Framework, outlining requirements for the placing on the market and conformity assessment of products.&lt;SEP&gt;This decision provides a common framework for the marketing of products in the EU, establishing compliance criteria.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8b474f9815c7033ca1ad8daff4012eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff05678672211287e9053ebcd9c1c6</data>
