      <data key="d0">Council Directive 85/374/EEC</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Council Directive 85/374/EEC addresses product liability, ensuring that consumers have rights and remedies in case of damages related to defective products, including AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Council Directive 85/374/EEC is a legislative document concerning the liability for defective products in the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Council Directive 85/374/EEC pertains to liability for defective products, influencing consumer protection laws in EU member states.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c28a81721b7de3ef4442495cc499b1cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5ff05678672211287e9053ebcd9c1c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620a69f3197e8df8e7c863ebf2c2155c</data>
