      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Collective Agreements are agreements between employers and a group of employees aimed at establishing terms of employment, including wages and working conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Collective agreements refer to contracts negotiated between employers and a group of employees aimed at regulating working conditions and rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Collective agreements refer to negotiated arrangements that may be implemented to improve worker rights in relation to the use of AI systems.</data>
