    <node id="national data protection authority">
      <data key="d0">national data protection authority</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">National data protection authorities are responsible for protecting citizens' data rights and overseeing the implementation of data protection laws, including those concerning biometric identification.&lt;SEP&gt;National data protection authorities ensure that data protection laws are followed, overseeing the use of personal data and privacy rights.&lt;SEP&gt;The national data protection authority is responsible for ensuring compliance with data protection laws and safeguarding personal data within their jurisdiction.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2187eb3476528ac7c75b571eb3844f0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27c28ab4482e4bec149657c656192c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4249f491e5466803d0f267a67c5cb39</data>
