      <data key="d0">National Data Protection Authority</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">National Data Protection Authorities ensure compliance with data protection laws and oversee the processing of personal data by organizations, including law enforcement.&lt;SEP&gt;National Data Protection Authorities oversee the application of data protection laws in their respective countries.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Data Protection Authority is responsible for enforcing data protection regulations, ensuring that individuals' personal data rights are upheld in accordance with legal frameworks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4988a00689afb1245e0f0ce4ceef5921&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4882abf1dd869d3dff00b8d88ee946a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2187eb3476528ac7c75b571eb3844f0e</data>
