      <data key="d5">1783934878</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI Practices">
      <data key="d0">AI Practices</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Practices include various methods and techniques employed in the development and implementation of AI systems, some of which may be prohibited by the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Practices refer to specific guidelines or behaviors related to artificial intelligence that are subject to regulation and compliance requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Practices refer to the usage of artificial intelligence technologies and applications, which must adhere to union laws.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Practices refers to a set of prohibitions regarding the deployment and use of artificial intelligence systems that manipulate or exploit individuals' behavior, decision-making, or personal characteristics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-911571ee28a1070a8fcc503dd5d91e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7365f713d09e74d49090cb78cb3e19b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
