    <node id="Deceptive Techniques">
      <data key="d0">Deceptive Techniques</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Deceptive techniques are strategies used to mislead or manipulate individuals, often employed within AI systems to influence decision-making without the person's conscious awareness.&lt;SEP&gt;Deceptive techniques in this context refer to methods used in AI systems that intentionally mislead individuals or groups, impacting their ability to make informed decisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a0ae2ebdd7c0c6e56069b878ca85c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef0a2a22402771842f4d35bbf4be08d</data>
