      <data key="d0">Vulnerabilities</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Vulnerabilities are weaknesses in a system that can be exploited by attackers to compromise security or functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Vulnerabilities refer to the weaknesses in individuals, such as age or economic status, that can be exploited by AI systems.</data>
