      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Facial Recognition Databases are collections of facial images used for identification, which may be created through data scraping techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Facial recognition databases are collections of facial images sourced from various platforms, which can lead to mass surveillance issues.</data>
