      <data key="d0">Facial Images</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Facial Images are pictures used for identification purposes, often included in facial recognition databases and subjected to data scraping.&lt;SEP&gt;Facial images are visual representations of individuals' faces, often used in biometric identification and emotion inference systems.</data>
