      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">CCTV footage involves video recordings from closed-circuit television cameras, often used in surveillance and security monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;CCTV footage refers to recorded video from closed-circuit television cameras, often used for surveillance and security purposes.</data>
