      <data key="d2">The workplace is an environment where individuals perform tasks for employment; it may involve the deployment of AI systems for monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;The workplace is an environment where the use of AI systems to detect emotional states raises serious concerns about intrusive practices.</data>
