    <node id="Harmonised Standards">
      <data key="d0">Harmonised Standards</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Harmonised Standards are technical specifications adopted by the EU to ensure compliance with regulations across member states, promoting consistency and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Harmonised Standards are technical specifications that ensure products meet EU requirements for safety, performance, and compatibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Harmonised standards are technical standards developed to ensure compliance with EU regulations and directives, reflecting the state of the art.&lt;SEP&gt;Harmonised standards are standards established to ensure that products, services, or systems comply with legal requirements, often published in the Official Journal of the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e24261c10195e33e965bd7e966c33337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9db4c15b43d1b7a1a1138d5a7403b240&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b837dd750c95d041180fa3d735328672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00e7606a0fa9d588f18d67d02cfcf654</data>
