    <node id="Advisory Forum">
      <data key="d0">Advisory Forum</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Advisory Forum is a consultative body that provides expertise and recommendations to the Commission regarding standardisation requests.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum is a group composed of co-chairs and stakeholders, responsible for holding meetings and preparing recommendations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum is established to provide technical expertise and advice to the Board and the Commission regarding the implementation of regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum is set up to ensure stakeholder involvement and provide expert advice to the Board and the Commission regarding the implementation of regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e24261c10195e33e965bd7e966c33337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad86065dee426d0a1db7444552c4a385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-699c5fa3a4d8d093e6a599637df82443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76666cf495bb0f0810313fe42e2c882</data>
