    <node id="New Legislative Framework">
      <data key="d0">New Legislative Framework</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The New Legislative Framework is a comprehensive set of regulatory measures developed by the European Union (EU) aimed at ensuring legal certainty, compliance, and safety in the development and deployment of various products, particularly those involving high-risk artificial intelligence (AI) systems. This framework establishes stringent safety and performance standards, facilitating consistent product compliance across member states and enhancing governance for technologies that incorporate AI.

Additionally, the New Legislative Framework provides guidelines and standards that support regulatory oversight, ensuring that products meet the necessary compliance requirements to access the market. It includes a collection of directives and regulations designed to improve the overall regulatory environment, thereby promoting safety and facilitating market access for innovative products. The initiative underscores the EU's commitment to fostering a regulatory landscape that balances technological advancement with public safety and legal clarity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-17ccf2ddbeca1f4e8b771a2316b7d16c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bf82c08e44c3a6e12c9472e052df840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-197c7357cf5fefe6ca4e08f847ff6a75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3e6894a9009f1db207c0ec639d8a39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2298fd83910d35175065de74977bd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c168b1207668ad4ba646371f91bfce09</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_46.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_83.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_87.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_124.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_64.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935777</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Value Chain">
      <data key="d0">Value Chain</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The value chain refers to the series of steps and processes involved in the development, distribution, and compliance of AI systems, highlighting the interconnectedness of different operators.&lt;SEP&gt;Value Chain refers to the sequence of activities and processes involved in the production and dissemination of content, including the roles of various stakeholders in detecting authenticity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51cb0d95dff3b7f033b351a9352b26a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-197c7357cf5fefe6ca4e08f847ff6a75</data>
