    <node id="National Authorities">
      <data key="d0">National Authorities</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">National Authorities are designated bodies within each EU member state responsible for compliance and enforcement of regulations concerning high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;National Authorities are governmental entities in EU member states tasked with overseeing regulations and ensuring compliance with EU laws.&lt;SEP&gt;National Authorities represent governmental agencies or bodies within the Member States responsible for law enforcement and judicial governance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d7f74259ac0ec20e9f3989df868f56b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a90a47461f525bba18d74c42ea04f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77911358a1d821f6b1731fac6d2dbd6</data>
