      <data key="d0">Article 12(1)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 12(1) likely refers to a specific provision in legislation that outlines requirements for logging and monitoring AI system operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 12(1) outlines the requirements for access to logs generated by high-risk AI systems, which competent authorities may request.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 12(1) refers to a specific provision within regulations that outlines requirements for the logging of data by providers of high-risk AI systems.</data>
