    <node id="Annex VIII">
      <data key="d0">Annex VIII</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Annex VIII contains specific guidelines and sections detailing the types of data to be included in the EU database.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex VIII includes supplementary information to the regulation, detailing specific obligations and requirements for providers of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex VIII outlines particular sections that detail information pertinent to the EU database regulations, except for specified exclusions.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex VIII provides detailed information required for the registration process of high-risk AI systems.</data>
