    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2017/745">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2017/745</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2017/745 is legislation enacted by the European Parliament and the Council concerning medical devices, aiming to ensure safety and efficacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2017/745 pertains to medical devices and sets forth the legal guidelines for their compliance and safety standards within the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2017/745 pertains to the establishment of rules about medical devices, including how certain changes affect compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2017/745 pertains to the safety and performance of medical devices, detailing risk classifications including those involving AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6a8bd64d122f5a09e9e3859bf77c6931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8efd21db4fc63a879493cbb376ae904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f1483cdf6b84729e33ebc4a611375b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3e6894a9009f1db207c0ec639d8a39</data>
