      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulatory obligations refer to the legal responsibilities that distributors, importers, and other entities must follow regarding high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Requirements that govern the behavior and practices of AI model providers to ensure compliance with established laws and standards for AI usage and transparency.</data>
