      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Providers of high-risk AI systems are organizations responsible for developing and managing AI systems that present significant risks, ensuring compliance with regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers of high-risk AI systems refer to entities or companies involved in offering AI technologies that entail significant risks and are encouraged to adhere to specific regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ac68c725e087cb7c659f2dd75f0a6e34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70337c5367702b9a8ef4dd8a241aa46d</data>
