      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Procedures outlined in Article 73 stipulate how serious incidents involving high-risk AI systems should be reported to ensure accountability.&lt;SEP&gt;Serious Incident Reporting Procedures outline the steps required for providers to report incidents involving high-risk AI systems to relevant authorities.</data>
