      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Relevant Authorities include various bodies that provide or support the access to data and are involved in the monitoring and regulation of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Relevant authorities are regulatory bodies that oversee the compliance and safety reporting of AI systems to ensure they meet legal and safety standards.</data>
