      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Quality management systems are regulatory frameworks ensuring that the organization adheres to required standards in producing its products or services.&lt;SEP&gt;Quality management systems are structured frameworks that ensure entities meet certain standards and regulations, relevant for both AI systems and financial institutions.</data>
