      <data key="d0">Very Large Online Platforms</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Very Large Online Platforms are online entities that have significant responsibilities under Regulation (EU) 2022/2065 regarding the dissemination of content.&lt;SEP&gt;Very large online platforms are significant digital services that embed AI systems and are obligated to assess systemic risks associated with them.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e7e1bc352c7c8d3a7ba58b9b1a4f9f37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cac929d0048fe34377179e8ecde4a5c</data>
