      <data key="d0">Very Large Online Search Engines</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Very Large Online Search Engines are major search engines subject to obligations for identifying and mitigating systemic risks under the regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Very large online search engines are powerful digital services that also embed AI systems and share obligations under the outlined regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e7e1bc352c7c8d3a7ba58b9b1a4f9f37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cac929d0048fe34377179e8ecde4a5c</data>
