    <node id="Interinstitutional Agreement of 13 April 2016 on Better Law-Making">
      <data key="d0">Interinstitutional Agreement of 13 April 2016 on Better Law-Making</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Interinstitutional Agreement aims to improve the quality of legislation and ensure better law-making processes across EU institutions.&lt;SEP&gt;This agreement lays down principles for cooperation among the EU institutions on legislation and law-making processes aimed at improving regulatory quality.&lt;SEP&gt;This is an agreement aimed at improving the legislative process within the European Union, focusing on effective decision-making.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-762d138929f27b0266d948c0aad50daa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da5fbf959baa6ee8e86278864a9144cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b7fd511ed97ef1a87c9783c3425b7d4</data>
