      <data key="d5">1783934653</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Council">
      <data key="d0">Council</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Council, formally known as the Council of the European Union or the Council of Ministers, is a vital institution within the European Union (EU) framework. It represents the governments of EU member states and plays a key role in the legislative process in collaboration with the European Parliament. The Council is responsible for discussing and adopting laws, as well as making decisions on a variety of policies and regulations.

In addition to its legislative functions, the Council is actively engaged in the development of regulations concerning artificial intelligence (AI). It considers reports and potential amendments related to AI, working closely with the European Commission and the European Parliament to evaluate proposals. The Council has the authority to receive pertinent documents simultaneously alongside experts from member states and participates in Commission expert group meetings related to delegated acts.

Overall, the Council's function as a decision-making body is essential for facilitating discussions among national ministers and contributing significantly to the legislative and policy development on crucial issues, including cybersecurity and AI regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6001fd4ce94d732804de396c3240c65f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a0c7f560be7dcbe4301aed20bcb98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b71cdb20a8fa5befb7c30c90163cd416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b837dd750c95d041180fa3d735328672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a69b68c9998277692ac6c6341fcdcac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d5cbcbecdcfde489e01bbfe08dc447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60a12c037b4dee54159c11f348ff3f11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da5fbf959baa6ee8e86278864a9144cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bedecbbbba0ded6846e6dc97756b7de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762d138929f27b0266d948c0aad50daa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eab6e21707d57be17832ef8dfd7180a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74def3a33d9c60f3c11227adf7704a09</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_62.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_112.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_11.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_29.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_173.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_97.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_78.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936160</data>
    </node>
