    <node id="Deployers of AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">Deployers of AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Deployers of AI Systems are entities or individuals responsible for implementing AI solutions, obligated to comply with various regulations including transparency.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployers of AI Systems are individuals or organizations that implement artificial intelligence technologies within the Union, adhering to regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployers of AI systems are organizations or individuals who utilize AI technologies in various applications and must adhere to established codes of conduct.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployers of AI Systems refers to entities or organizations responsible for implementing and managing artificial intelligence technologies and their compliance with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0373d38f7600f51def3b5e5cb5061d17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-714d9f621f6eee9273625419653b083c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0044fdddd0a21caecd46a12639588d98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40f3761e589fb7702938fd4fbbecfdcc</data>
