      <data key="d0">Non-Automatic Weighing Instruments Directive</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Non-Automatic Weighing Instruments Directive aims to regulate the making available on the market of non-automatic weighing instruments across EU member states.</data>
