      <data key="d0">OJ L 096 29.3.2014, p. 149</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">OJ L 096 29.3.2014, p. 149 is the official journal reference for the Directive 2014/32/EU, confirming its legislative status and provisions.</data>
