    </node>
    <node id="Directive (EU) 2019/1937">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2019/1937</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2019/1937 is a legal framework set by the European Union designed to ensure the protection of whistleblowers reporting infringements of regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2019/1937 is a piece of legislation from the European Parliament aimed at protecting whistleblowers who report infringements of Union law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1265df2d2f07835cf2aadd7299c694a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c582b50b1dcae6565f7384ebbe5e1</data>
