      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The EU Whistleblower Protection Directive encompasses legislation specifically designed to protect individuals who report breaches of EU law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74c582b50b1dcae6565f7384ebbe5e1</data>
