      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Standardisation deliverables are documents developed to support the AI Regulation and guide the implementation of AI practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Standardisation deliverables refer to the documents that outline specific standards and protocols for various technological developments, particularly in AI.</data>
