    <node id="Penalties">
      <data key="d0">Penalties</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Penalties are administrative fines or sanctions imposed on individuals or organizations that violate the regulations established by the EU for different activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Penalties refer to the legal consequences imposed on entities that fail to comply with the provisions of the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1b43f399350f0fc36795c0ce358459d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b837dd750c95d041180fa3d735328672</data>
