      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Articles 5 refers to a section within a legal framework that outlines specific obligations and penalties for infringements related to regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e7b8a0eb1cb8c27dfd822da15429870</data>
