      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Annex XII contains additional regulations or provisions that can be amended by the Commission in accordance with Article 97 and evolving circumstances.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex XII outlines further documentation elements that must be included by the providers of AI models to ensure compliance with regulations.</data>
