    <node id="Free and Open-Source Licence">
      <data key="d0">Free and Open-Source Licence</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A free and open-source licence allows users to access, modify, and distribute AI models, exempting them from certain obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;A legal framework that allows software to be freely used, modified, and shared, promoting open collaboration in development.&lt;SEP&gt;A free and open-source licence permits users to access, modify, distribute, and use software and data, enhancing transparency and innovation.</data>
