    <node id="Copyright and Related Rights">
      <data key="d0">Copyright and Related Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Copyright and Related Rights encompass the legal rights that creators have over their literary and artistic works, which are significant for providers using AI models trained on such content.&lt;SEP&gt;Copyright and related rights encompass the legal protections afforded to creators and their works, especially in the context of digital environments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feb00b9eef4af47cdd3264cd99d6b2e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1ae06c8c76fc5976313d75e4ffabdfc</data>
