    <node id="Article 4(3) of Directive (EU) 2019/790">
      <data key="d0">Article 4(3) of Directive (EU) 2019/790</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 4(3) of Directive (EU) 2019/790 outlines specific obligations regarding the reservation of rights in the context of copyright and related rights in digital media.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 4(3) of Directive (EU) 2019/790 outlines the requirements for identifying and complying with the rights of copyright holders, impacting AI model use.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1ae06c8c76fc5976313d75e4ffabdfc</data>
