      <data key="d0">administrative burden</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Administrative burden pertains to the workload and regulatory requirements that organizations face, often requiring extensive documentation and processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Administrative burden refers to the workload and costs associated with compliance and operational procedures that may disproportionately impact smaller enterprises.</data>
