      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Healthcare is a critical public interest area where high-risk AI systems can be deployed to improve service delivery.&lt;SEP&gt;Healthcare is one of the sectors benefiting from AI by improving patient care, treatment predictions, and operational efficiencies.</data>
