    <node id="European Artificial Intelligence Office">
      <data key="d0">European Artificial Intelligence Office</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European AI Office is an institution responsible for developing regulations, templates, and guidelines for the use of AI systems in Europe.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Artificial Intelligence Office, referred to as the AI Office, is involved in overseeing AI regulations and compliance, aiming to ease the burden for technology deployers.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Artificial Intelligence Office is an entity established by a commission decision to oversee matters related to artificial intelligence in Europe.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Artificial Intelligence Office is established to develop Union expertise and capabilities in the field of Artificial Intelligence and to implement Union law on AI.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb2945aab237268f7fcb2f55fd258be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee04f6104a24650416810ede28f3790b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6a5cc59273abbe42c743808026477c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89a194b461fcebd5ec31a53d66c4dde</data>
