      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 6(4) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 outlines the conditions under which personal data may be processed for purposes other than those for which it was originally collected.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 6(4) sets forth additional requirements and specifications for the registration of certain AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a46250ea72037444e96653239f2893b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72498ec90c19419f10373dde7e7b51b3</data>
