      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 9(2), point (g) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 provides specific provisions regarding the processing of personal data revealing racial or ethnic origin, political opinions, religious beliefs, and more, under certain conditions.</data>
