    <node id="Directive (EU) 2016/943">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2016/943</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2016/943 is a legislative act by the European Parliament aimed at protecting trade secrets within the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/943 is a legislative act that aims to protect trade secrets in the EU against unlawful acquisition, use, and disclosure.&lt;SEP&gt;This directive provides legal framework concerning the protection of undisclosed know-how and business information, impacting confidentiality in various sectors including technology.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9317b056c2a260423c79e368903cde7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf8a675497acfbeb420b95621b7cb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ec68339f2da8ef06976767a0d5b494</data>
