      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">National law refers to the legal frameworks within individual countries that dictate the conditions and safeguards related to the use of AI systems in law enforcement.&lt;SEP&gt;National law refers to the legal principles and statutes enacted by a country's government that govern its citizens and residents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75ec68339f2da8ef06976767a0d5b494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0db03f57b007cfc458657e88e273ae</data>
