      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulatory Authorities refer to official bodies that oversee and enforce laws and regulations, ensuring compliance within their jurisdictions, which can include trade confidentiality.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulatory authorities are public authorities that oversee compliance with regulations, including the supervision of financial institutions and markets.</data>
