      <data key="d2">The Regulation on Horizontal Cybersecurity Requirements establishes essential cybersecurity requirements for products with digital elements, particularly high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation sets forth the cybersecurity requirements for products with digital elements, which includes compliance standards for high-risk AI systems.</data>
