    <node id="Regulation on High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">Regulation on High-Risk AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Regulation on High-Risk AI Systems sets legal frameworks for the adaptation and continuity of AI systems in the market, particularly focusing on significant changes to their design or purpose.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation on High-Risk AI Systems sets the framework for ensuring the safety and ethical use of AI technologies within Europe, focusing on accountability and trusted access to data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8eae051373e28d701c4893438950556b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e</data>
