    </node>
    <node id="Operators of AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">Operators of AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Operators of AI Systems are entities responsible for managing AI technologies, especially those under the regulation, and must adapt their systems by certain deadlines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_177.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="2023">
      <data key="d0">2023</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The year 2023 is referenced as the general date of application for the high-risk AI systems regulation, indicating a major regulatory deadline.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_177.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="2030">
      <data key="d0">2030</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The year 2030 is specified as a deadline for operators of AI systems to comply with regulations regarding the use of high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_177.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="High-Risk AI Systems Regulation">
      <data key="d0">High-Risk AI Systems Regulation</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The High-Risk AI Systems Regulation is a legal framework designed to ensure the safe use and compliance of high-risk artificial intelligence systems in the market.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_177.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Adaptation Period">
      <data key="d0">Adaptation Period</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Adaptation Period refers to the timeframe allocated for operators to adjust their high-risk AI systems to comply with the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_177.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Market Continuity">
      <data key="d0">Market Continuity</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Market Continuity is an essential aspect of the Regulation, ensuring that the use of AI systems does not disrupt market activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_177.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Significant Change">
      <data key="d0">Significant Change</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Significant Change denotes alterations in the design or intended purpose of high-risk AI systems that trigger the application of the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_177.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Public Accountability">
      <data key="d0">Public Accountability</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Public Accountability is a principle emphasizing the responsibility of operators concerning the use of AI systems intended for public authorities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_177.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Legal Acts">
      <data key="d0">Legal Acts</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Legal Acts refer to regulations and directives that establish the requirements for conformity assessment of high-risk AI systems under EU law.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal Acts refer to the legislative documents mentioned in the annex that relate to large-scale IT systems and their operators.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b8c1122e1044e4445aa96d7fa6d5b6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e5d20a8e9427a4698b84f758676994</data>
