      <data key="d0">Article 261 TFEU</data>
      <data key="d1">legal regulation</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 261 TFEU refers to a provision within the Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union outlining the unlimited jurisdiction of the Court of Justice regarding penalties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ae3ab8a3b5c5d0c61e8b99fa718913b0</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_169.json</data>
