    <node id="TFEU">
      <data key="d0">TFEU</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">TFEU refers to the Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union, which outlines the operational procedures of the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union (TFEU) is a foundational treaty that outlines the operation of the EU, including the functioning and jurisdiction of its institutions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ae3ab8a3b5c5d0c61e8b99fa718913b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-500c97cae442a182ecf77fd6f39000b4</data>
