      <data key="d0">Technical Robustness</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Technical Robustness refers to the resilience of systems to function correctly despite errors, faults, and unexpected situations, crucial for high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f15de033aa4361b6dbf4b5d72ede05a5</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_75.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783934989</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Errors">
      <data key="d0">Errors</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Errors represent flaws or inaccuracies in the operation of AI systems that can lead to undesirable behavior and outcomes, necessitating reliable error management protocols.</data>
