      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 6(2) of the regulation refers to the stipulations regarding the registration of high-risk AI systems that need to be recorded.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 6(2) outlines the requirements for assessing the impact of high-risk AI systems on fundamental rights prior to deployment.</data>
