      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An impact assessment evaluates the potential implications of high-risk AI system deployment on fundamental rights and specifies necessary precautions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77a0a99b47c288a96d7474c796efb766</data>
