      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">EU Regulation refers to the framework of rules and laws governing various aspects of operations within the European Union, including data protection and technological oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU Regulation provides the legal framework for the management, registration, and accessibility of AI systems in the EU database.</data>
