      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 5(1) outlines specific provisions regarding the use of biometric systems and AI in police cooperation and judicial matters for EU member states.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 5(1) refers to specific provisions within the EU regulations that govern the use of biometric categorization systems and AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a2f07f347fedfe788b6636feb212d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-500c97cae442a182ecf77fd6f39000b4</data>
