      <data key="d0">Article 26(10)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 26(10) is a specific provision pertaining to data processing regulations in the context of EU justice and security policies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a2f07f347fedfe788b6636feb212d5</data>
