      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Treaty on European Union (TEU) establishes the foundation for the European Union's laws and governance frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Treaty on European Union outlines the legal foundation and guiding principles for the actions of the European Union member states and institutions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a2f07f347fedfe788b6636feb212d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cde8f1eff9bf42001a30603a860556d1</data>
