    <node id="Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union (TFEU)">
      <data key="d0">Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union (TFEU)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union (TFEU) provides the legal framework for the EU's functioning and the operation of its internal policies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-76a2f07f347fedfe788b6636feb212d5</data>
