      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2022/868 is a legislative document established by the European Parliament to govern data governance practices in the EU, impacting the handling of personal data.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2022/868, established on 30 May 2022, focuses on European data governance and amends the Data Governance Act.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8022b105f5e7e2d0ba74bbe75f31f87</data>
