      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2023/2854 is a legislative act related to data handling and processing standards, ensuring compliance with data governance in the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2023/2854, established on 13 December 2023, sets harmonized rules on fair access to and use of data in the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8022b105f5e7e2d0ba74bbe75f31f87</data>
