    <node id="Data Governance Act">
      <data key="d0">Data Governance Act</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Data Governance Act is a legislative framework in the EU that aims to facilitate data sharing and ensure data governance standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Data Governance Act is a legislative measure aimed at establishing rules governing the management and access to data within the EU, documented in the Official Journal on June 3, 2022.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f182220530b59a4450fc951016283bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2</data>
