      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Data Act outlines rules for the fair access and use of data in the EU, amending previous regulations to ensure compliance with modern data demands.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2</data>
