      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Competent Personnel refers to individuals who possess the necessary expertise to perform assessments or oversee the activities of the notifying authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent personnel refers to individuals who are well-qualified and skilled in overseeing the real-world testing of AI systems to ensure accuracy and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent personnel refers to individuals who possess the necessary expertise for their roles in various fields, such as information technologies, AI, and law.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad1a115533e7d3b3ced9ea8e2e87b0e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c712c6235ebe0b7ee5102919bbe87d08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58a25c0dd884625561b248cf275f154e</data>
