      <data key="d0">Article 74(11)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 74(11) outlines the provisions for cross-border market surveillance activities connected to AI systems, indicating compliance and regulatory measures.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 74(11) pertains to supporting cross-border market surveillance activities as defined within the regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 74(11) refers to a specific clause within the regulation detailing collaborative efforts among market surveillance authorities.</data>
