      <data key="d5">1783935720</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Provider of the General-Purpose AI Model">
      <data key="d0">Provider of the General-Purpose AI Model</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Provider of the General-Purpose AI Model refers to any entity that creates or supplies AI models that perform various functions and are subject to regulatory compliance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7c553a0db4b39033e7fcfeddeb912aac</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_91.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935428</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Article 68(2)">
      <data key="d0">Article 68(2)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Article 68(2) refers to provisions that guide the tasks and responsibilities of the scientific panel regarding information access.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7c553a0db4b39033e7fcfeddeb912aac</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_91.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935428</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Lawyers">
      <data key="d0">Lawyers</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lawyers act on behalf of their clients, providing legal information and ensuring client accountability for accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;Lawyers are authorized individuals who can represent clients in legal matters, including supplying information on behalf of AI model providers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5406d942407c55f04629004d833f8196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c553a0db4b39033e7fcfeddeb912aac</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_91.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935428</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Clients">
      <data key="d0">Clients</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Clients are individuals or entities represented by lawyers, responsible for the accuracy of information provided.&lt;SEP&gt;Clients are individuals or organizations that seek legal assistance and remain responsible for the accuracy of information provided on their behalf.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5406d942407c55f04629004d833f8196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c553a0db4b39033e7fcfeddeb912aac</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_91.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935428</data>
    </node>
    <node id="AI Model Provider">
      <data key="d0">AI Model Provider</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The provider of the general-purpose AI model offering legal consultation and information on behalf of clients, with an emphasis on the accuracy of provided information.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5406d942407c55f04629004d833f8196</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_91.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935428</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Public Health and Safety">
      <data key="d0">Public Health and Safety</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Public health and safety refer to the welfare and protection of the general public from health risks and safety hazards, which could be impacted by AI capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Human Intent Alignment">
      <data key="d0">Human Intent Alignment</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Human intent alignment refers to ensuring that AI systems act in ways that are consistent with human values and objectives to avoid unintended consequences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Chemical, Biological, Radiological, and Nuclear Risks">
      <data key="d0">Chemical, Biological, Radiological, and Nuclear Risks</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">These risks involve the potential threats posed by harmful agents or materials and their intersection with AI technology, necessitating caution in AI development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Major Accidents">
      <data key="d0">Major Accidents</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Major accidents are unforeseen events that can lead to widespread consequences, potentially exacerbated by the capabilities of AI.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Disruptions of Critical Sectors">
      <data key="d0">Disruptions of Critical Sectors</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Disruptions of critical sectors involve interruptions in essential services or infrastructure that are vital to society, which may be affected by AI deployment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Public and Economic Security">
      <data key="d0">Public and Economic Security</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Public and economic security involves the safeguarding of individuals, communities, and financial systems, which can be threatened by misuse of AI technologies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Illegal Content">
      <data key="d0">Illegal Content</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Illegal content refers to material or information that violates laws and regulations, potentially propagated through AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="False Content">
      <data key="d0">False Content</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">False content encompasses misinformation or disinformation that can undermine trust and integrity in communication, particularly related to AI.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Discriminatory Content">
      <data key="d0">Discriminatory Content</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Discriminatory content includes material that perpetuates bias or unfair treatment based on characteristics such as race or gender, which AI models may inadvertently generate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Misuse of AI Models">
      <data key="d0">Misuse of AI Models</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Misuse of AI models pertains to the improper or harmful application of artificial intelligence technologies, leading to unintended consequences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Model Reliability">
      <data key="d0">Model Reliability</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Model reliability refers to the consistency and dependability of AI systems in producing accurate and fair outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Model Fairness">
      <data key="d0">Model Fairness</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Model fairness involves ensuring that AI systems operate without bias, upholding equitable treatment across different user groups.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Model Security">
      <data key="d0">Model Security</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Model security pertains to the measures taken to protect AI systems from unauthorized access, tampering, or exploitation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3f46abe104a1bdb0fae1c25094db36d</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="models">
      <data key="d0">models</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Models refer to systems or frameworks that have the ability to replicate themselves or be trained, presenting various risks including bias, discrimination, and disinformation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-392a0705db576351b9cbccd6dcfdf33f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="disinformation">
      <data key="d0">disinformation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Disinformation encompasses false information that is deliberately spread to mislead, particularly concerning political or civic matters.&lt;SEP&gt;Disinformation involves the dissemination of false information that can undermine democratic values and human rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7570653f66cb58454b80be2046705a29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-392a0705db576351b9cbccd6dcfdf33f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_120.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935668</data>
    </node>
    <node id="democratic values">
      <data key="d0">democratic values</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Democratic values are principles that support a democratic society, including individual rights and freedom of expression.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-392a0705db576351b9cbccd6dcfdf33f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="human rights">
      <data key="d0">human rights</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Human rights are the fundamental rights and freedoms to which every individual is entitled, often threatened by disinformation and bias.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-392a0705db576351b9cbccd6dcfdf33f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="negative effects">
      <data key="d0">negative effects</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Negative effects refer to the adverse outcomes that can arise from self-replicating models, particularly on a large scale.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-392a0705db576351b9cbccd6dcfdf33f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Privacy">
      <data key="d0">Privacy</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Privacy pertains to individuals' rights to keep their personal information secure and private, which can be threatened by technological models and disinformation.&lt;SEP&gt;Privacy refers to the right of individuals to keep their personal information secure and protected from unauthorized access or processing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7d18c3755735a13a436e766a5ca73fc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-392a0705db576351b9cbccd6dcfdf33f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_69.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935659</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Democratic Values">
      <data key="d0">Democratic Values</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Democratic values are fundamental principles that uphold democracy, such as liberty and equality, which can be endangered by disinformation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-392a0705db576351b9cbccd6dcfdf33f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Event">
      <data key="d0">Event</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An event refers to a specific occurrence that may trigger a series of negative consequences, particularly in the context of self-replicating models.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-392a0705db576351b9cbccd6dcfdf33f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Chain Reaction">
      <data key="d0">Chain Reaction</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A chain reaction describes a series of events caused by a single triggering event, which can lead to extensive social or technological impacts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-392a0705db576351b9cbccd6dcfdf33f</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_110.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935457</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Union Copyright Law">
      <data key="d0">Union Copyright Law</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Union copyright law refers to the overarching legal framework governing copyright rights and related obligations within the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935464</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Transparency-Related Requirements">
      <data key="d0">Transparency-Related Requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Transparency-related requirements refer to the obligations imposed on AI models to disclose certain information regarding their architecture, training data, and compliance with laws under specific regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935468</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EU Copyright Law">
      <data key="d0">EU Copyright Law</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">EU copyright law comprises the regulations and directives that govern copyright rights within the European Union, impacting creators and users of digital content.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935468</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Open-Source License">
      <data key="d0">Open-Source License</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An open-source license allows users to freely use, modify, and distribute software code, which applies to certain general-purpose AI models.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-212b902a4529db42951674775ac3ec73</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783935468</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Digital Single Market">
      <data key="d0">Digital Single Market</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Digital Single Market is an initiative aiming to ensure the free movement of goods, services, and capital in the digital environment within the EU, which the AI Office aims to strengthen.&lt;SEP&gt;The Digital Single Market is an initiative by the European Union to ensure better access to online goods and services for individuals and businesses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feb00b9eef4af47cdd3264cd99d6b2e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6a5cc59273abbe42c743808026477c</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/recital_104.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_148.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783936007</data>
    </node>
    <node id="April 17, 2019">
      <data key="d0">April 17, 2019</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">This date marks the passage of the directive concerning copyright and related rights in the Digital Single Market, highlighting a significant legislative action.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-feb00b9eef4af47cdd3264cd99d6b2e4</data>
