    </node>
    <node id="Transparency Obligations">
      <data key="d0">Transparency Obligations</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Transparency Obligations are legal requirements that ensure AI systems and their output are made clear to users and relevant authorities, governing their lawful deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Transparency Obligations refer to the requirements imposed on AI system operators to disclose pertinent information about their systems to users and regulators.&lt;SEP&gt;Transparency obligations refer to requirements that AI systems must adhere to in order to inform users about their interactions with AI technology.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0044fdddd0a21caecd46a12639588d98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb43ec5a01dc502046ab6ffbe3a25504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0bd7056742f766183c11176d91fb1e8</data>
