    </node>
    <node id="Fundamental Rights Agency">
      <data key="d0">Fundamental Rights Agency</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Fundamental Rights Agency focuses on promoting and protecting fundamental rights in the EU and is included in stakeholder representation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fundamental Rights Agency is a permanent member of the advisory forum, focusing on fundamental rights issues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad86065dee426d0a1db7444552c4a385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76666cf495bb0f0810313fe42e2c882</data>
