    </node>
    <node id="ENISA">
      <data key="d0">ENISA</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">ENISA is the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity and a permanent member of the advisory forum.&lt;SEP&gt;ENISA, the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity, is responsible for enhancing network and information security across the EU and providing expertise on cybersecurity policy.&lt;SEP&gt;ENISA, the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity, is tasked with addressing cybersecurity policy and issues related to cybersecurity of AI systems under Regulation (EU) 2019/881.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union Agency for Cybersecurity (ENISA) provides expertise in cybersecurity matters and is part of the stakeholder advisory forum.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60a12c037b4dee54159c11f348ff3f11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ec0d2d3cbe2a53a3bbf6373c775edf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad86065dee426d0a1db7444552c4a385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76666cf495bb0f0810313fe42e2c882</data>
