      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">CEN develops and maintains a comprehensive suite of European standards and is involved in the advisory forum.&lt;SEP&gt;CEN is a permanent member of the advisory forum, responsible for developing and defining standards in Europe.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad86065dee426d0a1db7444552c4a385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76666cf495bb0f0810313fe42e2c882</data>
      <data key="d4">./cached_docs/article_67.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_150.json</data>
