      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">CENELEC is involved in electrotechnical standardization and is a permanent member of the advisory forum.&lt;SEP&gt;CENELEC prepares and publishes European standards for electrical and electronic goods, contributing expertise to the advisory forum.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad86065dee426d0a1db7444552c4a385&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76666cf495bb0f0810313fe42e2c882</data>
