      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Expertise in various fields, particularly related to AI, is a fundamental requirement for members of the advisory forum.&lt;SEP&gt;Expertise signifies the specialized knowledge or skills that individuals possess, necessary for performing their tasks effectively.</data>
