      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Sub-groups are smaller collectives within the Board dedicated to specific tasks or issues related to AI regulation and market surveillance.&lt;SEP&gt;Sub-groups are temporary or standing groups established by the Advisory Forum to tackle specific questions related to regulatory objectives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-699c5fa3a4d8d093e6a599637df82443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e28e08bfb7b1ae3208e2c91ea6f1e4e</data>
