      <data key="d0">High-Risk AI Systems Compliance Requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">High-risk AI systems compliance requirements encompass the specific standards and regulations that must be met for these systems to be considered safe and effective.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c72b31b17ef0accd3df4ab25a063163</data>
