    <node id="Ethics Guidelines for Trustworthy AI">
      <data key="d0">Ethics Guidelines for Trustworthy AI</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ethics Guidelines for Trustworthy AI outline principles intended to ensure AI is developed and used in a manner that is ethical, transparent, and accountable.&lt;SEP&gt;These guidelines, created by the High-Level Expert Group on AI, specify ethical standards for AI development and deployment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c14e1756e1d8d71ac3ba07125f122da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ded1c99cfd152513a4ef07b96a9c5de</data>
