      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Annex XIII contains criteria that the Commission uses to designate AI models as presenting systemic risks and to amend those criteria through delegated acts.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex XIII contains specific criteria involving the assessment of risks presented by general-purpose AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex XIII outlines specific criteria and benchmarks for evaluating AI model impacts as determined by the Commission.</data>
