      <data key="d2">Biometric identification systems refer to technologies that identify individuals based on physical or behavioral characteristics, and their use raises significant legal and ethical considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;Biometric identification systems utilize biological data to verify identities, necessitating careful oversight due to the potential consequences of errors.</data>
