    <node id="Certificates">
      <data key="d0">Certificates</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Certificates are authorizations issued by notified bodies that ensure compliance of high-risk AI systems with safety and regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Certificates are issued by notified bodies to demonstrate compliance with regulatory requirements; their validity can be affected by the body's designation status.&lt;SEP&gt;Certificates are official documents issued by notified bodies that confirm that a product meets the required standards and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Certificates are official documents issued by notified bodies that indicate conformity of AI systems to the specified requirements.</data>
