      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Health refers to the state of physical well-being that can be affected by the deployment of AI systems, especially high-risk ones.&lt;SEP&gt;Health refers to the well-being of individuals and communities that can be affected by the deployment and misuse of AI systems.</data>
