    <node id="Recital 134">
      <data key="d0">Recital 134</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Recital 134 defines transparency obligations for AI-generated content that is published for public interest.&lt;SEP&gt;Recital 134 refers to specific legislative guidance related to the obligations of AI system deployers regarding the disclosure of generated or manipulated content.</data>
