      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Obligations refer to the responsibilities outlined in the text concerning the disclosure of AI-generated or manipulated content to the public.&lt;SEP&gt;Obligations refer to the responsibilities regarding the detection and labeling of artificially generated or manipulated content.</data>
