      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Artificially generated content consists of material created or altered by algorithms rather than human effort.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificially generated content refers to text created or altered by an AI system and is the main subject of the disclosure requirements in the document.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3034aa8ff1b6d41ac6e0b8ff655b76ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50cb89ed7d0d818018d373ebefa65267</data>
