      <data key="d0">manipulated content</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Manipulated content involves text that has been altered or modified, similar to AI-generated content, and requires disclosure to the public.&lt;SEP&gt;Manipulated content refers to information that has been modified or distorted from its original form, often misleading users.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3034aa8ff1b6d41ac6e0b8ff655b76ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50cb89ed7d0d818018d373ebefa65267</data>
