    <edge source="Commission" target="European Parliament">
      <data key="d6">82.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission and the European Parliament work together to establish and implement directives aimed at ensuring the compliance and accuracy of artificial intelligence (AI) systems. Their collaborative efforts include the European Parliament overseeing the implementation of EU regulations effectively. The Commission plays a key role in this partnership by regularly reporting to the European Parliament on the evaluation and effectiveness of regulations concerning AI systems. As part of its regulatory responsibilities, the Commission submits various assessments and reports to the European Parliament, which are essential for evaluating regulatory measures and proposals related to AI and legislation. Through this cooperative framework, both entities strive to enhance the regulatory landscape surrounding AI within the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission works alongside the European Parliament to implement and propose regulations on high-risk AI systems and their safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission must notify the European Parliament of any delegated acts it adopts, indicating a direct relationship in the legislative process.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament can inform the Commission regarding its objections within a specified timeframe, influencing legislative processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament engages with the Commission by reviewing and approving legislative proposals initiated by the Commission.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,governance,legislative oversight,legislative process,notification,proposal approval,regulatory collaboration,regulatory communication,regulatory implementation,regulatory oversight,regulatory processes</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-d4ba1d5ee9be6a9378df917d6a467f31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a0c7f560be7dcbe4301aed20bcb98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20ac675fffdeba0fbc242b392d3af8da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b837dd750c95d041180fa3d735328672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a69b68c9998277692ac6c6341fcdcac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83f37d4143e19486af167d7acee5bee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fa5fe9ac042448be58de6c82bb33ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da5fbf959baa6ee8e86278864a9144cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762d138929f27b0266d948c0aad50daa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eab6e21707d57be17832ef8dfd7180a9</data>
