      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission evaluates and amends the classification and governance of various AI systems as per the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees the regulation of AI systems, specifically focusing on high-risk classifications and their implications for safety and rights.</data>
