    <edge source="Commission" target="National Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">32.0</data>
      <data key="d7">National competent authorities are responsible for reporting to the Commission about resources and compliance with the regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission collaborates with national competent authorities for reporting and managing incidents related to AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission works with national competent authorities to monitor the utilization of AI systems and their risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission works closely with National Competent Authorities to establish guidelines and ensure the consistent application of AI regulations.</data>
