    <edge source="Commission" target="Union Law">
      <data key="d6">26.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission has authority to amend Union Law concerning AI systems to enhance protections for fundamental rights and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission operates under the Union Law, ensuring that legislative measures related to AI systems are compliant with the overall legal framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission operates within the bounds of Union Law, which governs its decisions on authorizations and compliance checks.</data>
