    <edge source="Commission" target="Delegated Acts">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Delegated Acts are measures that the Commission can utilize to adjust regulatory frameworks relating to AI systems, reflecting its regulatory authority.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission can enact delegated acts to amend regulations based on evaluations of high-risk AI systems as technology evolves.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission has the authority to enact Delegated Acts to refine the criteria for assessing systemic risks related to AI models.</data>
      <data key="d8">criteria amendment,law adaptation,legislative process,regulatory authority,regulatory flexibility</data>
