    <edge source="Commission" target="AI System">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission establishes regulations that high-risk AI systems must comply with regarding their technical documentation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission has the authority to adopt acts that amend regulations related to high-risk AI systems, affecting their deployment and oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees the compliance of AI systems with the standards set in EU regulations.</data>
