      <data key="d7">"Market surveillance authorities collaborate with the Commission on joint activities and investigations to promote compliance."}&lt;SEP&gt;Market Surveillance Authorities notify the Commission about non-compliant AI systems and their actions regarding market regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission works in conjunction with Market Surveillance Authorities to ensure regulatory compliance and enforcement in the market.</data>
