    <edge source="Commission" target="High-Risk AI System">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission has a role in determining the conformity of High-Risk AI Systems as per Union Law requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission sets regulations that apply specifically to High-Risk AI Systems to ensure they meet safety standards.</data>
