    <edge source="Commission" target="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The Commission plays a role in enforcing and supporting the activities related to Regulation (EU) 2019/1020.";&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees the implementation of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, which governs market compliance of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission enforces Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, which governs market surveillance activities across Member States.</data>
