    <edge source="Commission" target="Article 97">
      <data key="d6">35.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission exercises powers granted under Article 97 to amend annexes and adopt delegated acts as necessary.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is authorized by Article 97 to adopt acts that ensure compliance with legal standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is empowered by Article 97 to adopt delegated acts for amending regulations, indicating its regulatory capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission uses Article 97 as a basis for adopting regulations related to AI model classification and benchmarks.</data>
