    <edge source="Commission" target="European Union">
      <data key="d6">28.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission operates under the authority of the European Union, enforcing regulations and compliance among Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission operates under the directives and regulations established by the European Union, implementing policies across member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union creates a framework within which the Commission operates to enforce regulations and set policy regarding AI models.</data>
