    <edge source="Commission" target="Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012">
      <data key="d6">42.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission applies provisions from Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012 when evaluating national measures on AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission applies the procedures defined in Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012 when national measures are considered justified.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission assesses harmonized standards according to the requirements specified in Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission plays a critical role in implementing and overseeing the Regulation regarding standardisation in the EU."+"regulatory compliance, oversight&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission operates under the guidelines set by Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012 to govern the standardisation process across the Union.</data>
