    <edge source="Commission" target="high-risk AI systems">
      <data key="d6">37.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission aims to ensure proper guidelines for the management and regulation of high-risk AI systems to protect public safety.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is tasked with assessing and reviewing the classification and governance of high-risk AI systems to ensure compliance with the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission establishes rules for the registration and management of high-risk AI systems to ensure public safety and compliance with legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission's role involves developing model terms specifically for high-risk AI systems to enhance cooperation along the value chain.</data>
