    <edge source="Commission" target="Council">
      <data key="d6">57.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission and the Council work closely together within the framework of the European Union to shape, implement, and regulate EU policies and legislation, particularly in the area of artificial intelligence (AI) regulations. The Commission plays a vital role by submitting findings, proposals, and evaluations to the Council. This collaboration allows the Council to review and potentially amend these regulations before they are enacted.

Moreover, the Council interacts with the Commission by receiving documents and participating in meetings regarding delegated acts, which are essential for the legislative process. The Commission is required to notify the Council of any delegated acts, further emphasizing their joint responsibility in EU decision-making.

The relationship between the Commission and the Council is characterized by cooperation in shaping legislation and policy. The Council not only collaborates with the Commission to oversee legislative proposals but also holds the power to convey objections, which may influence the legislative procedure. Collectively, both entities work to ensure that the EU's regulatory framework is effective and aligned with its broader goals.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,decision-making,executive collaboration,governance,legislative collaboration,legislative oversight,legislative process,legislative relationship,organizational cooperation,policy assessment,policy implementation,regulatory collaboration</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6001fd4ce94d732804de396c3240c65f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a0c7f560be7dcbe4301aed20bcb98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b837dd750c95d041180fa3d735328672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a69b68c9998277692ac6c6341fcdcac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da5fbf959baa6ee8e86278864a9144cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762d138929f27b0266d948c0aad50daa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eab6e21707d57be17832ef8dfd7180a9</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_112.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_173.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_97.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783936167</data>
    </edge>
