    <edge source="European Parliament" target="Council">
      <data key="d6">78.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both the European Parliament and the Council can jointly inform the Commission about their stance on legislative matters.&lt;SEP&gt;Both the European Parliament and the Council can oppose the extension of power delegated to the Commission, demonstrating checks and balances.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament and the Council play crucial roles in the legislative process of the European Union, working together to shape and implement policies that affect EU member states. They collaborate closely on a variety of legislative initiatives, including the discussions and approvals related to artificial intelligence regulations and practices. Their partnership is evident in the creation of significant regulations such as the Digital Services Act, reflecting their joint efforts in addressing contemporary challenges. Additionally, they work together to create and amend regulations pertaining to cybersecurity and AI systems, as well as consumer protection laws. Through their ongoing collaboration, the European Parliament and the Council ensure that the legislative framework in the EU is effectively developed and adapted to meet the needs of its citizens.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament and the Council work together in the legislative process of the EU, often consulting and negotiating on various acts.</data>
      <data key="d8">EU governance,checks and balances,collaboration,governance,legislative authority,legislative collaboration,legislative partnership,legislative procedure,legislative process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-de5a0c7f560be7dcbe4301aed20bcb98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a69b68c9998277692ac6c6341fcdcac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41d5cbcbecdcfde489e01bbfe08dc447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60a12c037b4dee54159c11f348ff3f11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da5fbf959baa6ee8e86278864a9144cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bedecbbbba0ded6846e6dc97756b7de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762d138929f27b0266d948c0aad50daa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eab6e21707d57be17832ef8dfd7180a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74def3a33d9c60f3c11227adf7704a09</data>
