      <data key="d6">29.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 updates Regulation (EU) No 167/2013, impacting the surveillance of agricultural vehicles influenced by AI legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 includes amendments and references to Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, indicating a relationship of legal progression in EU law regarding AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The implementation of AI systems in agricultural machinery will refer to the standards set in Regulation (EU) No 167/2013.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 receives updates through Regulation 2024/1689 to support new technological advancements in agricultural vehicles and AI systems.</data>
