      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 is amended to incorporate provisions from Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 concerning Artificial Intelligence systems and safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 incorporates changes to improve safety in aviation under Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 through AI regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The provisions of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 will impact AI components used in aviation safety standards as outlined in Regulation (EU) 2018/1139.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 is associated with Regulation 2024/1689 as it incorporates AI-related amendments to enhance aviation safety protocols.</data>
