      <data key="d6">32.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Chapter III, Section 2 of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 details requirements that must be taken into account in regulatory acts concerning AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter III, Section 2 outlines specific requirements for artificial intelligence safety components as detailed in Regulation (EU) 2024/1689.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter III, Section 2 provides specific technical specifications that must be accounted for when implementing Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 concerning AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter III, Section 2 outlines the requirements of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 for AI systems, establishing safety protocols.</data>
