    <edge source="AI Regulatory Sandbox" target="SMEs">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Regulatory Sandboxes provide opportunities for SMEs to engage in testing AI technologies under regulatory supervision, facilitating innovation while ensuring safety and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;SMEs, including start-ups, are encouraged to participate in the AI Regulatory Sandbox as a means to navigate AI regulations.</data>
