    <edge source="AI Regulatory Sandbox" target="Member States">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are mandated to establish AI regulatory sandboxes as part of their responsibilities to regulate AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States are responsible for establishing and overseeing the AI Regulatory Sandbox to test and regulate AI technologies.</data>
