      <data key="d7">The European Data Protection Supervisor may establish an AI regulatory sandbox to ensure compliance with data protection regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Data Protection Supervisor oversees the implementation of data protection regulations within AI Regulatory Sandboxes, ensuring compliance and protecting personal data rights.</data>
