    <edge source="Union Law" target="AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">42.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems are subject to Union Law, which sets forth guidelines to manage risks and ensure fundamental rights are protected.&lt;SEP&gt;Union law governs the classification of AI systems and determines which systems are considered high-risk based on their application.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems must adhere to Union law during research and development activities, maintaining ethical and professional standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Union law may regulate the use of AI systems to ensure compliance with principles of dignity and non-discrimination.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems must comply with union law protections regarding fundamental rights to ensure safe usage and deployment.</data>
