    <edge source="AI System" target="High-Risk AI System">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">An AI system can be categorized as high-risk based on its potential to cause significant harm, which necessitates separate assessment and regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems are a specific type of AI System that require stringent compliance with safety and regulatory standards.</data>
