    <edge source="AI System" target="Provider">
      <data key="d6">43.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The provider is responsible for developing and marketing an AI system."}&lt;SEP&gt;The Provider is responsible for supplying AI systems as per the Union's regulatory framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The Provider specifies the intended purpose and safety measures for the AI System, defining how it should be used and its limitations.&lt;SEP&gt;A provider must document the assessment of an AI system's risk level before it is allowed on the market, ensuring adherence to safety regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The provider is responsible for ensuring that the AI system is governed by appropriate regulations and guidelines to address its high-risk nature.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance responsibility,development,market readiness,marketplace,product development,regulation adherence,regulatory compliance,responsibility,supply</data>
