      <data key="d7">AI systems must adhere to regulations established by governing bodies such as the European Union and its Commission.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems must adhere to regulations that ensure they are safe and meet compliance requirements when integrated into products.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI system is governed by the Regulation that defines responsibilities and risk classifications for providers.&lt;SEP&gt;The classification of AI System as high-risk is directly related to the stipulations provided in the Regulation."(&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation prescribes how the high-risk AI system should be utilized to mitigate risks to health and safety.</data>
