    <edge source="Union" target="AI Office">
      <data key="d6">43.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office carries out initiatives and actions mandated by the Union to facilitate compliance and awareness regarding the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office operates within the framework set by the Union to regulate and guide the use of AI systems across member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office operates within the framework of the Union, aligning its practices with the broader regulatory environment established by member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office operates within the framework of the Union, ensuring adherence to AI regulations and standards across member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union establishes the legal framework within which the AI Office operates to enforce AI-related transparency regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">geographical oversight,governance,implementation,legal framework,operational authority,organizational role,regulatory authority,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight</data>
