    <edge source="Union" target="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems fall under the jurisdiction of the Union's harmonisation legislation, which provides the regulatory framework for their approval and oversight.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems are specifically addressed within the Union's regulations to protect public safety and rights.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union is responsible for creating regulations aimed at managing and overseeing high-risk AI systems to protect public interests.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,public safety,regulatory framework,risk classification,safety regulation</data>
