      <data key="d11">1783935574</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Union" target="Member States">
      <data key="d6">65.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are individual countries that make up the Union and play a crucial role in implementing regulations, particularly those concerning artificial intelligence (AI). Each Member State possesses special competencies under the framework of the Union, enabling them to manage national security issues related to AI systems effectively. Operating within this collaborative structure, Member States are entrusted with specific responsibilities that include not only national security but also the observance of regulations pertaining to AI and worker rights. The Union, on the other hand, oversees the operations of Member States, ensuring compliance in areas such as market surveillance and the reporting of serious incidents involving high-risk AI systems. Ultimately, the Union works in partnership with Member States to establish and enforce regulations that promote a cohesive internal market while ensuring the proper management of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union operates through its Member States, which engage in cooperation of law enforcement and judicial agreements with each other and with external entities.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States collaborate with the Union to implement regulations and participate in funding programmes aimed at innovation.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,cooperation,governance,governing body,market regulation,national competency,national governance,policy implementation,political relationship,regulation enforcement,regulatory framework,regulatory implementation,security management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6f892644f7a3eab6b024d8a386777f23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3105f8ed20ed5608a4571fe7b1d8f942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13991bdab077b3114e8913f89a1371e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86aff1d72a3f6226d0b5db29d9910a59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a90a47461f525bba18d74c42ea04f88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0455405f9e173535e78c4ea589745cf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0dc307b8b7cb1f0e39aa9b4b1839c408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ef16386f45c7bc364061cc094254fb</data>
