    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Natural Persons">
      <data key="d6">66.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems are intended to interact with natural persons, necessitating transparency about such interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems are used for identifying natural persons in public spaces, raising privacy and rights concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems play a significant role in assessing and influencing the lives of natural persons. These systems can discriminate against individuals based on their social behaviors and characteristics, raising concerns about fairness and equality. The evaluation of natural persons' emotions by AI systems may lead to intrusive practices, potentially infringing upon their rights. Additionally, AI systems assess the creditworthiness of individuals, which directly impacts their financial access and social opportunities. However, this reliance on AI for profiling and predictions can lead to unfair treatment of natural persons. While natural persons may use AI systems in their personal activities, they are exempt from certain obligations outlined in existing regulations. It is important to note that natural persons themselves are excluded from the operational scope of AI systems, as they lack the inferred capabilities characteristic of artificial intelligence. Overall, the interplay between AI systems and natural persons highlights both the potential benefits and the ethical challenges posed by the use of such technologies.</data>
      <data key="d8">discrimination,ethical concerns,evaluation,financial impact,human rights,individual rights,interaction,legal definitions,limitations,operational definition,personal use exemptions,profiling,social behavior,surveillance,transparency</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-eb43ec5a01dc502046ab6ffbe3a25504&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28efea7f8fe5945cce5b7be57e88efe7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8833999c9ef9aa31a007f2e77ffea02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd27f4cf61449e217b2273c0cf67adfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab148daacc5693b15ec462635a5502a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dead6db59d178a53a4fc03ed67a92e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431ae031d4ead528e84df75526b0f1dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83317eda1161cf5d13ef9aa07297c98b</data>
