    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Annex III">
      <data key="d6">31.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems are classified and assessed according to the criteria outlined in Annex III, which dictates high-risk categorizations.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex III categorizes AI Systems based on risk levels and other pertinent classifications for regulatory purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex III details specific area headings relevant to the evaluation of AI Systems as part of the regulatory framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex III specifies AI systems that need certification with a validity period of four years.</data>
