    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Member States">
      <data key="d6">44.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Systems should not be used by Member States to circumvent their obligations under international laws regarding refugees.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States are responsible for the market surveillance of high-risk AI systems as specified under EU regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States must ensure that AI systems in their jurisdiction comply with safety and fundamental rights regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States are considering the establishment of national rules regarding the trustworthy and safe development of AI Systems.".&lt;SEP&gt;Member States are responsible for the oversight and enforcement of regulations pertaining to AI Systems within their jurisdictions.</data>
