    <edge source="Member States" target="European Union">
      <data key="d6">28.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The European Union comprises Member States that are bound by its regulations and directives, particularly in regard to AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is composed of Member States that work together for mutual legal and judicial cooperation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Member States collectively form the European Union, which creates and enforces regulations such as Regulation (EU) No 182/2011.</data>
