    <edge source="Member States" target="market surveillance authority">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Market surveillance authorities must notify Member States of any non-compliance actions taken against AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States must inform market surveillance authorities about the implementation and use of biometric identification systems."&lt;&lt;"regulatory oversight, monitoring</data>
