    <edge source="Member States" target="Start-ups">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are tasked with providing priority access to AI regulatory sandboxes for Start-ups that meet the eligibility criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States focus on the development and support of start-ups within the framework of AI regulations to foster innovation.</data>
      <data key="d8">innovation,regulatory support,start-up facilitation,support</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e76c1f88e5810a7e79cf9527486831e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6ed86abb2e8f0e12897e923d1e9964</data>
