    <edge source="Regulation" target="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">117.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems are central to regulatory frameworks that establish stringent requirements aimed at ensuring transparency and safety prior to their deployment. Due to their potential significant impact on safety and individual rights, these systems receive heightened scrutiny within regulations, subjecting them to more rigorous oversight than other AI technologies. The regulations mandate compliance and continuous monitoring to maintain safety and performance standards, ensuring that High-Risk AI Systems operate legally and ethically. 

Additionally, these regulations dictate the safe processing and management of data sets to prevent biases and ensure ethical usage. They are particularly stringent in sectors such as healthcare, highlighting the critical importance of regulatory compliance. The Regulation specifically delineates requirements for the use of High-Risk AI Systems concerning natural persons, outlining the compliance process for providers and establishing a framework that governs their operation. This regulatory oversight is essential for protecting individuals' rights, thus reflecting the responsibility placed upon developers and operators of High-Risk AI Systems to adhere to these established safety and compliance requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulations are necessary to ensure that high-risk AI systems are deployed responsibly and that workers are adequately informed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulation outlines specific requirements for the use and operation of High-Risk AI Systems to safeguard public interests.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI governance,AI management,AI systems,compliance,compliance structure,governance,healthcare standards,legal compliance,legal oversight,protection,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,risk management,safety,safety requirements,technology compliance,worker safety</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3fc29985a43f3bd521b3a1c9eb9ba756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a65ec6b0fbd17afe47587686523a725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fde742696dfc1372a034cc9cadcb58d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c1d05b847c03fe702172f787883fc33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bf82c08e44c3a6e12c9472e052df840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc1203d6797827fbb6dbb7dc7c8d7d26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b754e2170dea6f93253ec4fd1fa88d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-727225adfedcad573a12c2ed92e8ee1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1d974005cd87fc21678c732472ee11a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ef16386f45c7bc364061cc094254fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c664ec81872dda212b64d449aa7a2014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5928be36056ac91865bd3e4d596159e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a57bbcc3ccf00f26352f12c36036aedf</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/recital_84.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_72.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_26.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_34.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_2.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_10.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_82.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_64.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_171.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_71.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_92.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_1.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_125.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783936330</data>
    </edge>
