    <edge source="AI Office" target="General-Purpose AI Model">
      <data key="d6">35.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office engages with providers of general-purpose AI models to discuss risk mitigation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office is involved in the evaluation and access processes of general-purpose AI models, ensuring they meet specified standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office takes action related to general-purpose AI models to ensure they adhere to the set regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office monitors general-purpose AI models to ensure compliance with systemic risk regulations as indicated by the Commission.</data>
