    <edge source="AI Office" target="Board">
      <data key="d6">58.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office is an entity that works closely with the Board, primarily acting on requests made by the Board concerning regulations. This collaborative relationship involves the AI Office communicating findings related to compliance evaluations and high-risk systems to the Board. Furthermore, both the AI Office and the Board jointly ensure the effective development, monitoring, and evaluation of codes of practice under the regulation. The AI Office plays a crucial role in supporting the Board by taking on secretarial duties, which includes organizing meetings and providing vital secretariat functions, thereby reinforcing their supportive organizational relationship. Overall, the AI Office and the Board are integral to upholding regulatory standards and frameworks within their operational scope.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office reports to the Board regarding compliance evaluations and findings related to AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">administrative support,collaboration,cooperation,directive relationship,governance,organizational hierarchy,organizational structure,oversight,regulatory communication,regulatory compliance,reporting structure</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-0b90abf0636c26d546e9b6724e3224ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4dc0271c68856282748506ff58069b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3d60cf6cbe0ae91a9793cb5c98a4a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6de18717bcb0167956be85a15dd210f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ca16d466deaa751e3b9dc390e91e2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4ac0ccf9bd954306cee6efbfd342416</data>
