    <edge source="AI Office" target="scientific panel">
      <data key="d6">72.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office collaborates closely with the scientific panel to enhance the oversight and classification of AI models. This partnership involves the scientific panel providing alerts and assessments regarding AI models that may pose systemic risks or require regulatory attention. The AI Office is not only receptive to these alerts but also consults the scientific panel for expert evaluations concerning the risks associated with various AI systems. Additionally, the AI Office supports the scientific panel in fulfilling its responsibilities related to the evaluation and regulation of general-purpose AI models, facilitating a comprehensive regulatory framework. This collaborative approach ensures that both entities work together effectively, with the scientific panel advising the AI Office on regulatory matters and, in turn, requesting assistance from the AI Office to carry out its tasks efficiently.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office collaborates with the scientific panel to ensure the oversight and enforcement of AI regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The scientific panel assists the AI Office in monitoring and addressing risks related to AI models.</data>
      <data key="d8">7,advisory role,collaboration,expert collaboration,expert support,monitoring,regulatory support,risk assessment,risk management,supporting governance,task assistance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8ec7c9ce58b650afe456517c2483e56c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0c1908573a7d6a832a6b35befbd7ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbcc9707fb1611da88a5526a5558a165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3c3fe390cb5d40b199e1bcc024928f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-140dff8b8263721e25ea86a4104c273d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c408a5b914a49af8b42e7e84ad02be6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23ab4f338bfa06297d4c996d7d54dc70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6579442a2f027e643cf907006333003a</data>
