      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Provider must cooperate with the AI Office in matters related to compliance and regulation surrounding AI technology.&lt;SEP&gt;The Provider works with the AI Office to ensure that their AI models meet the necessary legal and safety requirements for evaluation.</data>
