    <edge source="AI Office" target="Independent Experts">
      <data key="d6">24.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Independent experts provide insights and support to the AI Office in drafting and refining codes of practice.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office involves Independent Experts to facilitate the evaluations and provide objective assessments of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office can engage independent experts to assist in evaluations of AI model compliance.</data>
