    <edge source="AI Office" target="National Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">41.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"National competent authorities work alongside the AI Office to ensure proper regulatory oversight of AI model providers."}&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office collaborates with national competent authorities to ensure the effectiveness and compliance of codes of practice for AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office provides support and guidance to National Competent Authorities regarding the establishment and operation of AI Regulatory Sandboxes.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Competent Authorities work alongside the AI Office to ensure that providers comply with local regulations regarding AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office supports National Competent Authorities in developing regulatory sandboxes for AI systems.</data>
