    <edge source="AI Office" target="The Commission">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office can request updates to the guidelines from the Commission, ensuring that the guidelines remain relevant and effective.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees the AI Office, which is responsible for developing AI expertise and capabilities in the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission entrusts the AI Office with the implementation of supervisory tasks, demonstrating a hierarchical operational structure.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI development,delegation,guidelines oversight,organizational oversight,regulatory update,supervision</data>
