    <edge source="AI Office" target="Systemic Risks">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office addresses systemic risks by incorporating assessment and management strategies into the codes of practice.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office's codes of practice aim to address systemic risks from AI models by establishing risk assessment and mitigation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office is tasked with monitoring systemic risks associated with the deployment of general-purpose AI models.</data>
