      <data key="d6">26.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office invites providers of general-purpose AI models to adhere to the codes of practice to mitigate systemic risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office mandates that providers of general-purpose AI models submit technical documentation and cooperate with authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office is tasked with overseeing the compliance of providers of general-purpose AI models with established regulations.</data>
