    <edge source="AI Office" target="Market Surveillance Authorities">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office and market surveillance authorities collaborate to ensure compliance of high-risk AI systems and manage information confidentiality.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office collaborates with Market Surveillance Authorities to investigate and ensure compliance with the rules on providers of general-purpose AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office provides coordination support for joint investigations undertaken by market surveillance authorities regarding high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,compliance monitoring,regulatory oversight</data>
