    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020" target="Market Surveillance Authority">
      <data key="d6">53.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Market Surveillance Authority plays a crucial role in enforcing the provisions of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, which outlines the framework for market surveillance concerning product compliance within the European Union. This regulation delineates the authority and processes that the Market Surveillance Authority must adhere to, including the evaluation of AI systems to ensure they meet established compliance standards. Additionally, the regulation specifies the responsibilities of market surveillance authorities in monitoring adherence to these standards, as well as the procedures they must follow in handling complaints related to product compliance. Through its enforcement of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, the Market Surveillance Authority ensures that products available in the EU market align with necessary compliance requirements, thereby safeguarding consumer interests and upholding regulatory integrity.</data>
      <data key="d8">9,compliance,compliance assessment,enforcement,enforcement guidelines,oversight,regulation framework,regulatory enforcement,regulatory framework</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-43e82a7af456b2ae813a7217f92c2008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f12c01099dadb1fc1008ce18c7d800e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb2802f1b508b813d06e58ae27a1f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c27775e23d04f7dd6b8ec477a62efd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28daf57045ce50f0bd160cddd41ffc14</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_79.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_74.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_85.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_3.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783934695</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020" target="market surveillance authority">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The market surveillance authority enforces Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, overseeing compliance for products including AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">oversight,regulatory enforcement</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-c237e1a0b42db9afb10cc8a045dbb751</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_3.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783934170</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020" target="Market Surveillance Authorities">
      <data key="d6">51.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Market Surveillance Authorities operate under the provisions of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, which is designed to ensure product compliance across the European Union. This regulation empowers these authorities to enforce compliance with established standards, particularly in the context of high-risk AI systems. By adhering to the guidelines set forth in Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, Market Surveillance Authorities manage compliance and enforce regulations within the market. They utilize this regulation to guide their monitoring and enforcement actions, thereby fulfilling their responsibilities in product compliance and market surveillance duties.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,compliance monitoring,enforcement,market regulation,operational framework,oversight,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-bc8a3a685818e1a12850434d4ddcb5cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345a8ba89ed0ea3325462384d5e16aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0fa7bd172fb09094c2d62c87957967&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0711090702fd9b1787822998d5deac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbe4515f5aa3b0876e436a8a0dffc23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf8a675497acfbeb420b95621b7cb31</data>
      <data key="d10">./cached_docs/article_79.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_74.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_75.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/recital_156.json&lt;SEP&gt;./cached_docs/article_78.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783936212</data>
    </edge>
